{"id":"a7710809-c7b6-55cb-aff7-132dc24b1897","key":"banded-hip-thrust","name_fr":"Hip thrust avec mini-bande","name_en":"Banded Hip Thrust","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"hip-thrust","variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band","bench"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","glutes"],"instructions_fr":["Place une mini-bande juste au-dessus des genoux et assieds-toi au sol, le haut du dos contre un banc.","Fléchis les genoux, pose les pieds à largeur de hanches et ajuste la bande pour créer de la tension.","Pousse dans les talons, étends les hanches et décolle les fessiers du sol jusqu'à former une ligne droite des épaules aux genoux.","Serre fort les fessiers en haut, en poussant les genoux vers l'extérieur contre la bande.","Redescends lentement les hanches jusqu'à la position de départ, de façon contrôlée."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-hip-thrust/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-hip-thrust/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-hip-thrust"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"0917bd38-790d-570f-affa-d4f40671c205","key":"banded-it-band-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement bandelette ilio-tibiale élastique","name_en":"Banded IT-Band Stretch","aliases_fr":["Étirement TFL élastique"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["resistance_band"],"primary_muscles":["abductors"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","gluteus_medius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos avec un élastique autour d'un pied levé.","Tiens l'élastique avec la main opposée.","Amène la jambe tendue en travers de ton corps vers le sol.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-it-band-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"14a224b2-c7dc-53bb-8318-add4e56b8fc4","key":"banded-kneeling-hip-thrust","name_fr":"Hip thrust à genoux avec élastique","name_en":"Banded Kneeling Hip Thrust","aliases_fr":["Poussée de hanche à genoux à l'élastique"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"hip-thrust","variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","glutes"],"instructions_fr":["Fixe un élastique en bas d'un poteau solide, à hauteur de tes hanches quand tu es à genoux, et passe-le autour des hanches. Mets-toi à genoux dos au poteau, torse droit et genoux à largeur de hanches, assez loin pour que l'élastique soit tendu.","Recule les hanches vers les talons en te penchant légèrement vers l'avant, dos droit et abdominaux gainés.","Lance le mouvement en serrant les fessiers et pousse les hanches vers l'avant jusqu'à ce que le torse soit droit.","Serre fort les fessiers en haut, en gardant la tension sur l'élastique.","Inverse lentement le mouvement en contrôlant la résistance de l'élastique jusqu'à la position de départ."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-kneeling-hip-thrust/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-kneeling-hip-thrust/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-kneeling-hip-thrust"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"a2c110b8-4b04-5bca-a418-ede7087ffa03","key":"banded-lat-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement dorsaux élastique","name_en":"Banded Lat Stretch","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["resistance_band"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["posterior_deltoid"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens un élastique au-dessus de la tête à deux mains, légèrement tendu.","Penche-toi en avant en pliant aux hanches, les bras tendus devant toi.","Laisse la poitrine descendre pour étirer les côtés du dos.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-lat-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"07e89094-bc69-5e13-bfff-2fd0db5bfc9f","key":"banded-lateral-walk","name_fr":"Marche latérale mini-bande","name_en":"Banded Lateral Walk","aliases_fr":["Lateral band walk","Marche latérale activation fessiers"],"aliases_en":["Glute activation mini band walk"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_medius"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","distance_m"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Place une mini-bande autour des jambes au-dessus des genoux (ou autour des chevilles pour une version plus dure).","Mets-toi en quart de squat : pieds à largeur d'épaules, hanches en arrière, poitrine haute, genoux dans l'axe des pointes de pieds.","Fais un pas de côté avec un pied, contre la tension de la bande.","Ramène l'autre pied vers le premier, en gardant la bande tendue tout le temps, sans laisser les pieds se rejoindre d'un coup.","Continue les pas latéraux dans une direction pour les répétitions ou la distance prescrites, puis change de sens.","Reste bas tout au long, sans te redresser entre les pas."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-lateral-walk/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-lateral-walk/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-lateral-walk","coory-glute-activation-mini-band-walk"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"6bb19d8e-8c2d-595d-9264-d5efc3f0028f","key":"banded-rear-delt-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement arrière d'épaule élastique","name_en":"Banded Rear Delt Stretch","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["resistance_band"],"primary_muscles":["posterior_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["rhomboids","trapezius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Passe un élastique autour d'un bras et tiens l'autre bout.","Amène ce bras à l'horizontale en travers de ta poitrine.","Aide-toi de l'élastique pour accentuer doucement l'étirement.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-rear-delt-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"60523407-8f4d-569e-89ba-23c372a5dd30","key":"banded-romanian-deadlift","name_fr":"Soulevé de terre roumain mini-bande","name_en":"Banded Romanian Deadlift","aliases_fr":["SDT roumain élastique"],"aliases_en":["Banded RDL"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"deadlift","variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull","legs"],"instructions_fr":["Monte avec les deux pieds sur une mini-bande et saisis le haut de la bande.","Place les pieds à largeur de hanches, genoux légèrement fléchis.","Penche-toi en charnière de hanches en faisant glisser les mains le long des jambes.","Descends jusqu'à sentir un étirement des ischio-jambiers.","Pousse les hanches vers l'avant pour te redresser."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-romanian-deadlift/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-romanian-deadlift/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-romanian-deadlift"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"ae612f22-cc77-5b4c-a2a6-095a6b80c311","key":"banded-seated-hip-abduction","name_fr":"Abduction de hanche assis mini-bande","name_en":"Banded Seated Hip Abduction","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"hip-abduction","variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_medius"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","glutes"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi sur un banc ou une chaise, une mini-bande autour des genoux.","Garde les pieds à plat au sol, à largeur de hanches, et le buste bien droit.","Pousse les genoux vers l'extérieur contre la bande en contractant les fessiers.","Maintiens brièvement la contraction maximale, puis ramène lentement les genoux à la position de départ.","Contrôle le mouvement sur toute l'amplitude."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-seated-hip-abduction/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-seated-hip-abduction/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-seated-hip-abduction"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"b8b1c0d4-0c21-595e-a0bf-4af3925b54dd","key":"banded-shoulder-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement épaules élastique","name_en":"Banded Shoulder Stretch","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["resistance_band"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens un élastique derrière ton dos, une main en haut et une en bas.","Garde une légère tension dans l'élastique.","Ouvre la poitrine et ramène doucement les épaules vers l'arrière.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-shoulder-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"50cd1e0c-34a1-5817-bf3d-7271ab36052c","key":"banded-squat","name_fr":"Squat mini-bande","name_en":"Banded Squat","aliases_fr":["Squat avec élastique"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Place une mini-bande juste au-dessus des genoux.","Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur d'épaules, pointes légèrement vers l'extérieur.","Pousse les genoux vers l'extérieur contre la bande pendant que tu descends.","Descends jusqu'à ce que les cuisses soient parallèles au sol ou plus bas.","Pousse dans les talons pour te relever."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"cc2f6c52-949a-5ab0-99b4-47f9f2dccf2c","key":"banded-standing-curl","name_fr":"Leg curl debout à l'élastique","name_en":"Banded Standing Leg Curl","aliases_fr":["Curl ischio debout à l'élastique"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"leg-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band"],"primary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","pull"],"instructions_fr":["Passe un élastique autour d'une cheville et fixe l'autre extrémité sous ton pied d'appui ou à un point fixe devant toi.","Tiens-toi bien droit, en t'appuyant sur quelque chose pour l'équilibre si besoin, avec une légère flexion du genou d'appui.","Ramène le talon vers le fessier en fléchissant la jambe, la cuisse immobile.","Serre les ischio-jambiers en haut, puis redescends de façon contrôlée jusqu'à l'étirement complet.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change de jambe."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-standing-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-standing-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-standing-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"90ef2f60-b9b3-5a7f-aa06-954d465ff7b3","key":"banded-standing-hip-abduction","name_fr":"Abduction de hanche debout mini-bande","name_en":"Banded Standing Hip Abduction","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"hip-abduction","variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_medius"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","glutes"],"instructions_fr":["Place une mini-bande autour des chevilles ou juste au-dessus des genoux.","Tiens-toi bien droit, genoux légèrement fléchis, abdominaux gainés.","Reporte ton poids sur une jambe en gardant le buste stable.","Écarte lentement la jambe libre sur le côté en sentant le fessier se contracter.","Contrôle le mouvement en ramenant la jambe à la position de départ.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté avant de changer."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-standing-hip-abduction/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-standing-hip-abduction/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-standing-hip-abduction"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"c9b27dd8-c6c5-5690-aa71-d595e36e7e8a","key":"banded-standing-hip-adduction","name_fr":"Adduction de hanche debout mini-bande","name_en":"Banded Standing Hip Adduction","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band"],"primary_muscles":["adductors"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Fixe une mini-bande à un support solide à hauteur de cheville.","Passe la jambe de travail dans la boucle, côté ancrage.","Éloigne-toi de quelques pas pour que la bande soit tendue.","Balance la jambe de travail en travers du corps vers la jambe d'appui.","Reviens lentement au départ. Fais les répétitions de chaque côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-standing-hip-adduction/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-standing-hip-adduction/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-standing-hip-adduction"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"edb66ea6-e6a7-5b93-a65b-0ebad7bcf367","key":"banded-sumo-walk","name_fr":"Marche sumo mini-bande","name_en":"Banded Sumo Walk","aliases_fr":["Pas latéraux mini-bande"],"aliases_en":["Banded monster walk"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"hip-abduction","variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","gluteus_medius"],"secondary_muscles":["quadriceps"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","glutes"],"instructions_fr":["Place une mini-bande autour des jambes, juste au-dessus des chevilles.","Descends en quart de squat, pieds plus larges que les épaules.","Fais des pas sur le côté en gardant un écart large et la bande tendue.","Ramène le pied arrière seulement à moitié pour que la bande reste tendue, et continue de marcher sur la distance prévue avant de changer de jambe directrice.","Reste bas du début à la fin : ne te redresse pas entre les pas."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-sumo-walk/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-sumo-walk/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-sumo-walk"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"14f72d2f-bb2a-5a50-9344-ef45f677c35c","key":"banded-terminal-knee-extension","name_fr":"Extension de genou finale mini-bande","name_en":"Banded Terminal Knee Extension","aliases_fr":["Terminal knee extension"],"aliases_en":["TKE"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["mini_band"],"primary_muscles":["quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Fixe une mini-bande à un support solide à hauteur de genou.","Passe dans la boucle pour que la bande soit derrière un genou.","Recule pour que la bande tire le genou en légère flexion.","Tends complètement le genou contre la bande en contractant le quadriceps.","Reviens lentement. Fais les répétitions de chaque côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/banded-terminal-knee-extension/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/banded-terminal-knee-extension/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-terminal-knee-extension"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"ccdb6bba-37a3-5045-ab96-e575b7144a9a","key":"banded-triceps-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement triceps élastique","name_en":"Banded Triceps Stretch","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["resistance_band"],"primary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens un élastique qui descend le long de ton dos, la main du haut derrière la tête.","Cale la main du bas au niveau du bas du dos.","Descends la main du haut pour sentir les triceps s'allonger.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-banded-triceps-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"d0728e9a-efb4-5a54-88f8-c7c20308811b","key":"barbell-ab-rollout","name_fr":"Roulette abdominale barre","name_en":"Barbell Ab Rollout","aliases_fr":["Rollout à la barre"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","obliques","transverse_abdominis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Charge des disques de taille identique aux deux extrémités d'une barre et pose-la au sol.","Mets-toi à genoux derrière la barre et attrape-la à largeur d'épaules, bras tendus.","Gaine fortement les abdominaux, puis fais rouler la barre vers l'avant en l'éloignant de ton corps.","Va aussi loin que tu peux garder la colonne neutre, et arrête-toi avant que les hanches s'affaissent.","Ramène la barre à la position de départ en contractant les abdominaux et les dorsaux.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions recommandé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-ab-rollout/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-ab-rollout/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-ab-rollout"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"be0e7044-9a29-5d7e-8de6-45d1978a6370","key":"barbell-box-squat","name_fr":"Box squat barre","name_en":"Barbell Box Squat","aliases_fr":["Squat sur box barre"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","powerlifting"],"instructions_fr":["Place une box ou un banc derrière toi, à une hauteur où tes cuisses se retrouvent à peu près parallèles au sol quand tu t'assois dessus.","Place la barre sur le haut du dos, recule d'un pas et tiens-toi debout, pieds un peu plus larges que les épaules.","Gaine le tronc et pousse les hanches vers l'arrière, puis descends de façon contrôlée vers la box.","Assieds-toi sur la box sans te laisser tomber, poitrine haute et tibias proches de la verticale.","Marque une brève pause en gardant les muscles tendus, sans relâcher le dos.","Pousse avec tout le pied pour te relever, et répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-box-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-box-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-box-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"410da1bd-3f1b-53e4-8c02-08049fda5bd8","key":"barbell-bulgarian-split-squat","name_fr":"Squat bulgare barre","name_en":"Barbell Bulgarian Split Squat","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","erector_spinae","gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Place une barre sur le haut du dos et tiens-toi à environ 60 cm devant un banc plat, dos tourné à lui.","Pose le dessus d'un pied sur le banc derrière toi, le pied avant assez avancé pour garder le tibia proche de la verticale en descendant.","Gaine le tronc et descends le genou arrière vers le sol en fléchissant la hanche et le genou avant.","Descends jusqu'à ce que la cuisse avant soit à peu près parallèle au sol, poitrine haute.","Pousse dans le milieu du pied avant pour revenir au départ.","Fais toutes les répétitions sur une jambe, puis change de jambe."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-bulgarian-split-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-bulgarian-split-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-bulgarian-split-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"81eecfda-e16a-5ca4-a4bf-49697034f9a5","key":"barbell-calf-raise","name_fr":"Extension des mollets barre","name_en":"Barbell Calf Raise","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"calf-raise","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gastrocnemius"],"secondary_muscles":["soleus"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place une barre sur le haut du dos comme pour un squat.","Tiens-toi debout, l'avant des pieds sur une plateforme surélevée.","Monte sur la pointe des pieds le plus haut possible.","Marque une pause et serre les mollets en haut.","Descends les talons sous la plateforme et répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-calf-raise/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-calf-raise/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-calf-raise"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"d9b220b8-c43e-5325-8624-8568baaf649d","key":"barbell-curl","name_fr":"Curl barre","name_en":"Barbell Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["brachialis","forearm_flexors"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout avec une barre en prise supination à largeur d'épaules.","Monte la barre vers les épaules.","Serre en haut, puis redescends de façon contrôlée.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"f75582e9-71b7-520e-a6c3-a108ff42670e","key":"barbell-front-raise","name_fr":"Élévations frontales barre","name_en":"Barbell Front Raise","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"front-raise","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["lateral_deltoid","pectoralis_major","serratus_anterior"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, barre tenue en pronation à hauteur des cuisses.","Garde les bras tendus et les abdominaux gainés.","Lève la barre devant toi jusqu'à hauteur d'épaules.","Marque une courte pause en haut.","Redescends sous contrôle et répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-front-raise/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-front-raise/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-front-raise"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"05ca3456-2c98-5fb8-ae96-67301acbdc94","key":"barbell-glute-bridge","name_fr":"Pont fessier barre","name_en":"Barbell Glute Bridge","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"hip-thrust","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi au sol avec une barre posée sur les hanches et les genoux fléchis.","Monte les hanches en serrant les fessiers.","Tiens la position en haut, hanches complètement étendues.","Redescends de façon contrôlée.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-glute-bridge/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-glute-bridge/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-glute-bridge"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"4b61d9bd-27fc-57b9-b5a3-82e4f10ee571","key":"barbell-isometric-squat-hold","name_fr":"Squat isométrique barre","name_en":"Barbell Isometric Squat Hold","aliases_fr":["Maintien squat barre"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Place la barre sur le haut du dos, saisis-la juste à l'extérieur des épaules et recule du rack, pieds à environ largeur d'épaules.","Inspire profondément dans le ventre, gaine les abdominaux et garde la poitrine haute.","Descends en t'asseyant vers l'arrière jusqu'à ce que les cuisses soient à peu près parallèles au sol ou un peu plus bas, genoux dans l'axe des orteils.","Arrête-toi en bas et maintiens la position, poids au-dessus du milieu des pieds.","Garde le dos plat et les genoux poussés vers l'extérieur pendant tout le maintien prévu.","Pousse dans les pieds pour te relever, puis replace la barre sur le rack."],"image_main":"/exercises/barbell-isometric-squat-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-isometric-squat-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"0d91105e-a1be-58ac-a5ed-b500c88c8f30","key":"barbell-lunge","name_fr":"Fentes barre","name_en":"Barbell Lunge","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lunge","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place une barre sur le haut du dos et tiens-toi droit.","Fais un grand pas en avant avec une jambe.","Descends le genou arrière vers le sol jusqu'à ce que la cuisse avant soit parallèle.","Pousse dans le talon avant pour revenir debout.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-lunge/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-lunge/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-lunge"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"75e77dcf-db67-5ac2-9cbd-df9f9fed3c89","key":"barbell-overhead-extension","name_fr":"Extension triceps barre au-dessus de la tête","name_en":"Barbell Overhead Extension","aliases_fr":["Extension nuque barre"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"overhead-tricep-extension","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","push"],"instructions_fr":["Charge une barre avec un poids adapté et tiens-toi debout ou assis, colonne neutre.","Prends la barre en pronation, à largeur d'épaules, et pousse-la au-dessus de la tête.","Descends lentement la barre derrière la tête en fléchissant les coudes, bras fixes.","Tends les coudes pour ramener la barre en position haute en contractant les triceps.","Garde le contrôle pendant tout le mouvement, sans élan."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-overhead-extension/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-overhead-extension/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-overhead-extension"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"daa569d1-f549-575a-bfb5-48a83bf8160b","key":"barbell-preacher-curl","name_fr":"Curl pupitre barre","name_en":"Barbell Preacher Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["brachialis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","pull"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi au pupitre, la poitrine contre le coussin, et prends la barre en supination à largeur d'épaules.","Appuie bien le haut des bras sur le coussin, les coudes légèrement fléchis au départ.","Monte la barre en contractant les biceps, sans décoller le haut des bras du coussin.","Serre les biceps en haut du mouvement, en cherchant la contraction maximale.","Redescends lentement la barre à la position de départ, en contrôlant la phase négative.","Descends jusqu'à avoir les bras presque tendus pour étirer complètement les biceps."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-preacher-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-preacher-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-preacher-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"936761db-7c7f-5e92-9aa5-c8100189f748","key":"barbell-pullover","name_fr":"Pull-over barre","name_en":"Barbell Pullover","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"pullover","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi en travers d'un banc, une barre tenue au-dessus de la poitrine.","Redescends la barre derrière la tête en arc de cercle.","Ramène-la au départ au-dessus de la poitrine.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-pullover/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-pullover/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-pullover"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"ba4c25b4-a7f5-516d-9d7a-0017d63bd48e","key":"barbell-rear-delt-row","name_fr":"Rowing barre buste penché prise large","name_en":"Barbell Rear Delt Row","aliases_fr":["Oiseau barre"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"rear-delt-row","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["posterior_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","rhomboids","trapezius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Penche-toi à partir des hanches, dos plat, jusqu'à ce que le buste soit presque parallèle au sol.","Tiens une barre en pronation, prise plus large que les épaules, bras pendants.","Tire la barre vers le haut de la poitrine, coudes écartés sur les côtés.","Marque une pause et contracte les deltoïdes postérieurs et le haut du dos en haut.","Redescends la barre en contrôlant et répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-rear-delt-row/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-rear-delt-row/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-rear-delt-row"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"b049e4fd-d474-5424-884e-1f6022c9cde4","key":"barbell-reverse-lunge","name_fr":"Fentes arrière barre","name_en":"Barbell Reverse Lunge","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lunge","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place une barre sur le haut du dos et tiens-toi droit.","Recule un pied dans un grand pas.","Descends le genou arrière vers le sol de façon contrôlée.","Pousse dans le talon avant pour revenir debout.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-reverse-lunge/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-reverse-lunge/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-reverse-lunge"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"6763692a-f6af-52e0-b5ce-c39fd5d8d208","key":"barbell-row","name_fr":"Rowing barre buste penché","name_en":"Bent-Over Barbell Row","aliases_fr":["Rowing barre"],"aliases_en":["Bent over row"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"row","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","rhomboids"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","posterior_deltoid"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Penche le buste en partant des hanches, genoux légèrement fléchis.","Saisis la barre un peu plus large que les épaules.","Tire la barre vers le bas de la poitrine en serrant les omoplates.","Redescends la barre de façon contrôlée.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-row/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-row/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-row"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"48177881-4eeb-5b26-903d-9dba595e0f83","key":"barbell-wrist-curl","name_fr":"Curl poignets barre","name_en":"Barbell Wrist Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["forearm_flexors"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","grip"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi sur un banc, avant-bras posés sur les cuisses, paumes vers le haut.","Tiens une barre, mains à largeur d'épaules, poignets dépassant des genoux.","Laisse la barre rouler jusqu'au bout des doigts en bas.","Remonte la barre en fléchissant les poignets.","Redescends en contrôlant."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/barbell-wrist-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/barbell-wrist-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-wrist-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"ac18a123-faa9-5d86-b572-78f7fb6a1d8c","key":"barbell-zercher-hold","name_fr":"Maintien Zercher","name_en":"Barbell Zercher Hold","aliases_fr":["Zercher hold"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["rectus_abdominis","transverse_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","erector_spinae","obliques","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Place une barre sur un rack à environ hauteur du bas des côtes et glisse les creux des coudes sous la barre.","Replie les bras et joins les mains devant la poitrine pour bloquer la barre contre ton corps.","Soulève la barre du rack et recule d'un pas, pieds à environ largeur d'épaules.","Tiens-toi droit, gaine les abdominaux et garde les côtes basses, pour que la barre repose contre l'abdomen sans te tirer vers l'avant.","Maintiens la position pendant le temps prévu, en respirant lentement et en gardant les coudes serrés l'un contre l'autre.","Repose la barre sur le rack, ou pose-la au sol de façon contrôlée."],"image_main":"/exercises/barbell-zercher-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-zercher-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"14a512c3-9ddf-52f8-8dd2-7d6241019288","key":"barbell-zercher-squat-hold","name_fr":"Maintien squat Zercher","name_en":"Barbell Zercher Squat Hold","aliases_fr":["Zercher squat hold"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Place une barre sur un rack à environ hauteur du bas des côtes, glisse les creux des coudes sous la barre et joins les mains devant la poitrine.","Soulève la barre du rack, recule d'un pas et tiens-toi debout, pieds à environ largeur d'épaules.","Gaine les abdominaux et garde la poitrine haute, puis descends en t'asseyant vers l'arrière jusqu'à ce que les cuisses soient à peu près parallèles au sol.","Arrête-toi en bas et maintiens, coudes appuyés à l'intérieur des genoux et genoux poussés vers l'extérieur au-dessus des orteils.","Garde la barre près de l'abdomen et le dos droit pendant tout le maintien prévu.","Pousse dans les pieds pour te relever et replace la barre sur le rack."],"image_main":"/exercises/barbell-zercher-squat-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-barbell-zercher-squat-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"d777b5ac-3fd6-5301-a12b-a6442b4635f9","key":"battle-rope-double-slam","name_fr":"Double slam battle ropes","name_en":"Battle Rope Double Slam","aliases_fr":["Slam battle ropes à deux bras"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"active","disciplines":["cardio"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["battle_rope"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","gluteus_maximus","obliques","quadriceps","rectus_abdominis","trapezius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s","reps"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["full_body","conditioning"],"instructions_fr":["Prends une extrémité de corde dans chaque main et fais face à l'ancrage, assez loin pour que les cordes aient un peu de mou.","Écarte les pieds un peu plus que les hanches et descends en quart de squat, poitrine haute.","Lève les deux bras ensemble en laissant les cordes monter devant toi, en t'étendant par les hanches.","Frappe le sol avec les deux extrémités en même temps, en charnière de hanches et en t'appuyant sur les dorsaux.","Enchaîne directement sur le slam suivant grâce au rebond, en gardant les deux bras synchronisés et sans alterner.","Continue les slams pendant la durée ou le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/battle-rope-double-slam/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/battle-rope-double-slam/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-battle-rope-double-slam"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"8a515a08-2883-5b89-bb5c-ec77bf18ffb9","key":"battle-ropes","name_fr":"Battle ropes","name_en":"Battle Ropes","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"active","disciplines":["cardio"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["battle_rope"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","lateral_deltoid","latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","quadriceps","rectus_abdominis","trapezius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s","reps"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["full_body","conditioning"],"instructions_fr":["Fixe les cordes à un point fixe et attrape une extrémité dans chaque main.","Recule pour que les cordes aient un mou modéré.","Descends en quart de squat, pieds à largeur d'épaules.","Monte et descends chaque bras rapidement pour créer des vagues dans les cordes.","Continue pendant l'intervalle de travail prescrit."],"image_main":"/exercises/battle-ropes/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-battle-ropes"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"52096e9d-6334-5516-be5e-9f8c20e5ccdd","key":"bear-crawl","name_fr":"Bear crawl","name_en":"Bear Crawl","aliases_fr":["Marche de l'ours"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["obliques","quadriceps","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["full_body","conditioning","core"],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi à quatre pattes, mains sous les épaules et genoux sous les hanches.","Replie les orteils et décolle les genoux du sol de quelques centimètres.","Dos plat et hanches basses, avance ensemble la main droite et le pied gauche.","Puis avance la main gauche et le pied droit, et progresse vers l'avant à un rythme contrôlé.","Garde les abdominaux gainés et évite que les hanches se balancent d'un côté à l'autre."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/bear-crawl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/bear-crawl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-bear-crawl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"a5a0a525-a555-52d2-8605-b0fd61eead10","key":"bear-plank-hold","name_fr":"Planche de l'ours (maintien)","name_en":"Bear Plank Hold","aliases_fr":["Bear plank"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"plank","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["rectus_abdominis","transverse_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","obliques","quadriceps","serratus_anterior"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi à quatre pattes, mains sous les épaules et genoux sous les hanches.","Replie les orteils et gaine les abdominaux pour que le dos reste plat.","Appuie dans les mains et décolle les genoux du sol d'environ 5 cm.","Tiens la position, hanches à niveau et tête dans l'alignement de la colonne.","Respire régulièrement, puis repose les genoux pour te reposer."],"image_main":"/exercises/bear-plank-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-bear-plank-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"e6b72ac4-517c-5383-977d-28a605bfe5e3","key":"behind-the-back-barbell-shrug","name_fr":"Shrugs barre dans le dos","name_en":"Behind the Back Barbell Shrug","aliases_fr":["Haussements d'épaules barre derrière le dos"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"shrug","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","rhomboids"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout avec une barre derrière le dos, en pronation.","Garde les bras tendus et la poitrine haute.","Hausse les épaules à la verticale vers les oreilles.","Marque une pause et serre en haut.","Redescends de façon contrôlée et répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/behind-the-back-barbell-shrug/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/behind-the-back-barbell-shrug/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-behind-the-back-barbell-shrug"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"d8474bc6-715d-550a-bd19-7fbeb194c40d","key":"behind-the-neck-lat-pulldown","name_fr":"Tirage vertical nuque","name_en":"Behind-the-Neck Lat Pulldown","aliases_fr":["Tirage nuque"],"aliases_en":["Behind the neck pulldown"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lat-pulldown","variant_of":null,"equipment":["lat_pulldown_machine"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["posterior_deltoid","rhomboids","trapezius"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi à la station de tirage vertical, cuisses bloquées sous le pad.","Attrape la barre en prise large et en pronation, plus large que les épaules.","Garde le torse droit et rentre légèrement le menton.","Tire la barre derrière la tête jusqu'à la base de la nuque.","Remonte de façon contrôlée jusqu'à l'étirement complet bras tendus.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/behind-the-neck-lat-pulldown/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/behind-the-neck-lat-pulldown/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-behind-the-neck-lat-pulldown"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"74e47d83-474f-547b-9a52-87ff0287bb3a","key":"behind-the-neck-press","name_fr":"Développé nuque","name_en":"Behind the Neck Press","aliases_fr":["Développé militaire nuque"],"aliases_en":["BTN press"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"overhead-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","lateral_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["trapezius","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Assis ou debout, place une barre sur le haut des trapèzes derrière la nuque.","Prends la barre plus large que les épaules.","Pousse la barre à la verticale au-dessus de la tête jusqu'à avoir les bras tendus.","Redescends la barre à la position de départ de façon contrôlée.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/behind-the-neck-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/behind-the-neck-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-behind-the-neck-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"b026a65f-2141-56a2-92eb-a21f1d786851","key":"behind-the-neck-pull-ups","name_fr":"Tractions pronation derrière la nuque","name_en":"Behind-the-Neck Pull-Up","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"pull-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","posterior_deltoid","rhomboids","trapezius"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Prends la barre de traction en pronation, plus large que les épaules, et suspends-toi bras tendus, jambes serrées.","Garde le buste vertical sans te pencher en arrière et tire les coudes vers le bas et vers l'extérieur.","Continue de tirer jusqu'à ce que la barre passe derrière la tête et que l'arrière de la nuque arrive à son niveau, sans laisser la barre toucher la nuque.","Redescends en contrôlant jusqu'à la suspension complète, en gardant la tête immobile sans la laisser partir brusquement vers l'avant.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/behind-the-neck-pull-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/behind-the-neck-pull-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-behind-the-neck-pull-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
