{"id":"a813a18c-d796-5f7f-8ddf-14eb4baa03b0","key":"handstand-hold","name_fr":"Équilibre sur les mains","name_en":"Handstand Hold","aliases_fr":["Handstand hold"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"static-hold","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","rectus_abdominis","serratus_anterior","trapezius"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["calisthenics","shoulders","core"],"instructions_fr":["Place les mains au sol à peu près à largeur d'épaules et monte en position inversée, une jambe après l'autre.","Pousse grand dans les épaules et garde les bras verrouillés.","Serre les fessiers et les abdominaux pour que le corps forme une ligne droite des mains aux orteils.","Regarde entre tes mains et maintiens la position, avec de petites corrections des doigts.","Redescends en contrôlant, une jambe à la fois, ou sors de la position en faisant un pas."],"image_main":"/exercises/handstand-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-handstand-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"caa38752-ce2c-58cf-aee4-b5411ea072cc","key":"handstand-push-ups","name_fr":"Pompes en équilibre (handstand)","name_en":"Handstand Push Ups","aliases_fr":["Handstand push-ups"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"push-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["lateral_deltoid","rectus_abdominis","trapezius"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place deux parallettes à largeur d'épaules et monte en équilibre sur les mains, sans appui, dessus.","Gaine les abdominaux et garde le corps droit, jambes serrées.","Fléchis les coudes pour descendre la tête entre les poignées.","Descends jusqu'à ce que la tête soit à peu près au niveau des poignées.","Repousse dans les poignées jusqu'aux bras tendus, en gardant l'équilibre.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/handstand-push-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/handstand-push-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-handstand-push-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"4c58ee29-8c00-5f82-87dd-0d0d23033344","key":"hang-clean","name_fr":"Hang clean (épaulé en suspension)","name_en":"Hang Clean","aliases_fr":["Épaulé en suspension"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"clean","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps","trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["olympic_lifting"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, barre à bout de bras sur les cuisses, prise à largeur d'épaules.","Penche-toi en charnière de hanches pour descendre la barre juste au-dessus des genoux.","Étends explosivement les hanches, les genoux et les chevilles.","Hausse les épaules et tire la barre vers le haut.","Passe sous la barre et réceptionne-la sur l'avant des épaules en squat complet.","Redresse-toi, puis reviens en position suspendue."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/hang-clean/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/hang-clean/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hang-clean"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"efeaa9ee-8d00-5b06-b6eb-bfc0d686e792","key":"hang-power-clean","name_fr":"Hang power clean","name_en":"Hang Power Clean","aliases_fr":["Power clean en suspension"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"clean","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps","trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["olympic_lifting"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur de hanches, barre tenue sur les cuisses.","Penche-toi en charnière de hanches pour descendre la barre juste au-dessus des genoux.","Pousse fort avec les hanches et les jambes de façon explosive.","Tire la barre vers le haut et réceptionne-la sur l'avant des épaules en demi-squat.","Redresse-toi, barre en appui sur les épaules.","Redescends la barre en position suspendue."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/hang-power-clean/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/hang-power-clean/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hang-power-clean"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"1148c9f9-8f88-5284-ba63-a83bd0eb1dd2","key":"hang-snatch","name_fr":"Hang snatch","name_en":"Hang Snatch","aliases_fr":["Arraché en suspension"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"snatch","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps","trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["olympic_lifting"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout avec une barre à hauteur de cuisses, en prise large d'arraché, pieds à environ largeur de hanches.","Fléchis les hanches pour descendre la barre juste au-dessus des genoux, dos plat et épaules au-dessus de la barre.","Étends les hanches, les genoux et les chevilles de façon explosive, en haussant les épaules pendant que la barre monte.","Passe sous la barre et réceptionne-la au-dessus de la tête, bras verrouillés, en squat.","Termine en te relevant complètement, barre stable au-dessus de la tête.","Redescends la barre de façon contrôlée jusqu'aux cuisses et replace-toi."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/hang-snatch/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/hang-snatch/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hang-snatch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"0b3e9eb4-6dda-5421-8c29-5b97cfc549fd","key":"hanging-knee-raise","name_fr":"Relevé de genoux suspendu","name_en":"Hanging Knee Raise","aliases_fr":["Hanging knee raise"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","obliques"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Suspends-toi à une barre de traction en prise pronation, bras complètement tendus.","Gaine les abdominaux et monte les genoux vers la poitrine.","Marque une courte pause en haut.","Redescends lentement les jambes à la position de départ.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/hanging-knee-raise/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/hanging-knee-raise/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hanging-knee-raise"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"41964704-3e35-5535-b96d-d0cb8027e2b4","key":"hanging-l-sit","name_fr":"L-sit suspendu","name_en":"Hanging L-Sit","aliases_fr":["Hanging L-sit"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"static-hold","variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","latissimus_dorsi","quadriceps","transverse_abdominis"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core","calisthenics","grip"],"instructions_fr":["Suspends-toi à une barre de traction en pronation, bras tendus et épaules abaissées.","Gaine les abdominaux et lève les jambes tendues jusqu'à ce qu'elles soient parallèles au sol.","Garde les genoux verrouillés, les pointes de pieds tendues et les jambes serrées.","Maintiens la position sans balancer, en respirant régulièrement.","Redescends les jambes en contrôlant jusqu'à la suspension complète."],"image_main":"/exercises/hanging-l-sit/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hanging-l-sit"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"7645e1be-5424-563a-b522-886b38114f23","key":"hanging-leg-raise","name_fr":"Relevé de jambes suspendu","name_en":"Hanging Leg Raise","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"leg-raise","variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["obliques"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Suspends-toi à une barre de traction en pronation.","Monte les jambes devant toi jusqu'à ce qu'elles soient parallèles au sol.","Tiens brièvement, puis redescends de façon contrôlée.","Évite de te balancer.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/hanging-leg-raise/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/hanging-leg-raise/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hanging-leg-raise"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"80dabbb4-aa57-5c53-9b42-54e18aadb92f","key":"hanging-pike","name_fr":"Pike suspendu","name_en":"Hanging Pike","aliases_fr":["Hanging pike"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","hip_flexors","latissimus_dorsi"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Suspends-toi à une barre de traction en prise pronation à largeur d'épaules.","Contracte les dorsaux et gaine les abdominaux pour créer une position creuse.","Jambes parfaitement tendues, monte-les en arc fluide jusqu'à la barre.","Essaie de toucher la barre avec les orteils, entre les mains.","Redescends lentement les jambes en position suspendue et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/hanging-pike/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/hanging-pike/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hanging-pike"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"fdd61653-49e3-5029-b96f-24412cfbc943","key":"hanging-tuck-hold","name_fr":"Maintien genoux groupés suspendu","name_en":"Hanging Tuck Hold","aliases_fr":["Hanging tuck hold"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"static-hold","variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","latissimus_dorsi","obliques","transverse_abdominis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core","calisthenics","grip"],"instructions_fr":["Suspends-toi à une barre de traction en pronation, bras tendus.","Gaine les abdominaux et monte les genoux vers la poitrine en arrondissant légèrement le bas du dos.","Garde les genoux serrés et les cuisses à hauteur de hanches ou au-dessus.","Maintiens la position groupée sans balancer et respire régulièrement.","Redescends les jambes en contrôlant jusqu'à la suspension complète."],"image_main":"/exercises/hanging-tuck-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hanging-tuck-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"fa3317a6-2b94-5e5c-802f-12599893804d","key":"happy-baby","name_fr":"Posture du bébé heureux","name_en":"Happy Baby Pose","aliases_fr":["Ananda Balasana","Bébé heureux"],"aliases_en":["Happy baby"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["adductors","gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos et ramène les deux genoux vers la poitrine.","Attrape le bord extérieur des pieds, ou les tibias si les pieds sont hors de portée.","Ouvre les genoux plus large que les côtes et place les chevilles au-dessus des genoux, plantes de pieds vers le plafond.","Pousse doucement les pieds dans les mains et tiens le temps prévu, le bas du dos posé au sol.","Relâche les pieds et redescends les jambes."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-happy-baby"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"069cdbc5-b933-5b47-b687-15bded184826","key":"head-to-knee-pose","name_fr":"Posture tête vers le genou","name_en":"Head-to-Knee Pose","aliases_fr":["Janu Sirsasana"],"aliases_en":["Janu Sirsasana"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","gluteus_maximus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi avec une jambe tendue devant toi et l'autre genou plié sur le côté, le pied contre l'intérieur de la cuisse.","Tourne la poitrine vers la jambe tendue pour que le nombril soit aligné avec la cuisse.","Penche-toi en pliant aux hanches et tends-toi vers l'avant le long de la jambe tendue, la colonne allongée.","Tiens la flexion le temps prévu, en respirant vers l'arrière de la jambe.","Remonte le dos plat et recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-head-to-knee-pose"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"f4021d04-6064-5c9a-b904-2d940d33eb51","key":"heel-elevated-squat","name_fr":"Squat talons surélevés","name_en":"Heel-Elevated Squat","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Place des disques ou une cale sous tes talons, pieds à largeur d'épaules.","Tiens une barre sur le haut du dos ou des haltères le long du corps.","Gaine les abdominaux et descends en squat en gardant le buste droit.","Descends jusqu'à ce que les cuisses soient parallèles au sol ou plus bas.","Pousse dans les pieds pour revenir à la position de départ."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/heel-elevated-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/heel-elevated-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-heel-elevated-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"4f909b39-25f8-5e7d-a1da-0a1155a71dc1","key":"heel-flicks","name_fr":"Talons-fesses","name_en":"Heel Flicks","aliases_fr":["Montées de talons aux fessiers","Heel flicks"],"aliases_en":["Butt kicks drill"],"category":"cardio","visibility":"active","disciplines":["cardio","warmup","running"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","gluteus_maximus","hip_flexors"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["distance_m","duration_s","reps"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["conditioning","full_body"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi droit, pieds sous les hanches et bras fléchis comme pour courir.","Commence à trottiner doucement sur place.","Ramène un talon vers le fessier du même côté, sans pousser le genou vers l'avant.","Change de pied rapidement et continue en alternant à un rythme régulier.","Reste léger sur l'avant des pieds et garde le buste droit pendant tout l'intervalle."],"image_main":"/exercises/heel-flicks/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-heel-flicks","coory-butt-kicks-drill"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"fa33a38d-9eb5-5d36-aaad-1230ca427814","key":"heel-to-toe-walk","name_fr":"Marche talon-pointe","name_en":"Heel-to-Toe Walk","aliases_fr":["Marche en tandem"],"aliases_en":["Tandem walk"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","soleus"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","quadriceps","transverse_abdominis"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Choisis une ligne droite au sol et place-toi dessus, bras écartés sur les côtés à hauteur d'épaules.","Avance un pied et pose le talon juste devant les orteils du pied d'appui, en les touchant.","Transfère ton poids sur le pied avant en contrôlant et marque une courte pause avant le pas suivant.","Amène le pied arrière devant et pose-le à nouveau talon contre pointe, en restant sur la ligne.","Regarde un point fixe devant toi plutôt que tes pieds, et utilise les bras pour corriger les déséquilibres.","Fais le nombre de pas voulu, puis fais demi-tour et reviens."],"image_main":"/exercises/heel-to-toe-walk/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-heel-to-toe-walk"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"fca931e0-e5d6-5375-bc4b-dd6c0dd68ade","key":"heel-touches","name_fr":"Heel touches","name_en":"Heel Touches","aliases_fr":["Toucher de talons"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"crunch","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["obliques","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos, genoux fléchis, pieds à plat au sol, à peu près à largeur de hanches.","Décolle légèrement la tête et les épaules du sol et tends les bras le long du corps.","Enroule le buste d'un côté et amène la main vers le talon du même côté.","Reviens au centre et va chercher le talon opposé.","Continue d'alterner les côtés à un rythme fluide, le bas du dos restant au sol.","Poursuis pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/heel-touches/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/heel-touches/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-heel-touches"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"7793854a-22e8-5d3f-ac5d-21afac7b73e0","key":"hero-pose","name_fr":"Posture du héros","name_en":"Hero Pose","aliases_fr":["Virasana"],"aliases_en":["Virasana"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","hip_flexors"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi à genoux, genoux joints et pieds un peu plus écartés que les hanches, dessus des pieds à plat.","Assieds les hanches en arrière et vers le bas entre les talons, avec un bloc ou un coussin si le sol est hors de portée.","Empile les côtes au-dessus du bassin et pose les mains sur les cuisses.","Tiens l'assise le temps prévu, le poids réparti également sur les deux ischions.","Sors en appuyant sur les mains et en tendant une jambe après l'autre."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hero-pose"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"aeb8914e-01c8-52f2-8b33-8bc6ecff70ca","key":"hex-bar-deadlift","name_fr":"Soulevé de terre barre hexagonale","name_en":"Hex Bar Deadlift","aliases_fr":["Soulevé de terre trap bar"],"aliases_en":["Trap bar deadlift"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"deadlift","variant_of":null,"equipment":["trap_bar"],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","hamstrings","trapezius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi à l'intérieur d'une barre hexagonale chargée, pieds à largeur d'épaules.","Penche-toi en fléchissant hanches et genoux pour saisir les poignées.","Gaine les abdominaux et mets le dos à plat.","Pousse dans les talons et étends hanches et genoux pour te redresser.","Verrouille en haut, épaules en arrière.","Repose la barre au sol sous contrôle."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/hex-bar-deadlift/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/hex-bar-deadlift/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hex-bar-deadlift"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"1531a64a-8c7f-5661-8e36-0189c9fee9b0","key":"high-foot-leg-press","name_fr":"Presse à cuisses pieds hauts","name_en":"High-Foot Leg Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"leg-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["leg_press"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","glutes"],"instructions_fr":["Règle le dossier et le siège pour que ton bas du dos reste appuyé et que tes genoux puissent se fléchir sans que le bassin se décolle.","Place les deux pieds hauts sur la plateforme, à peu près à largeur d'épaules, orteils dans la même direction que les genoux.","Descends le chariot en fléchissant hanches et genoux jusqu'à une profondeur confortable, sans que le bas du dos décolle du pad.","Pousse avec tout le pied et étends hanches et genoux, sans verrouiller les genoux de force.","Redescends le chariot de façon contrôlée et répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/high-foot-leg-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/high-foot-leg-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-high-foot-leg-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"15da9471-f1a3-5e79-9f16-f13595fa8668","key":"high-knees","name_fr":"Montées de genoux","name_en":"High Knees","aliases_fr":["High knees","Course montée de genoux"],"aliases_en":["High knees running"],"category":"cardio","visibility":"active","disciplines":["cardio","warmup","running"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","rectus_abdominis"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["distance_m","duration_s","reps"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["full_body"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi droit, pieds à largeur de hanches.","Monte un genou vers la poitrine en balançant le bras opposé.","Change de jambe rapidement, en alternant avec les bras.","Continue en alternant à un rythme rapide.","Continue pendant l'intervalle de travail prescrit."],"image_main":"/exercises/high-knees/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-high-knees","coory-high-knees-running"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
