{"id":"a9b33b2a-9149-5824-ae97-045cd8161b94","key":"hip-thrust","name_fr":"Hip thrust barre","name_en":"Barbell Hip Thrust","aliases_fr":["Poussée de hanche"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"hip-thrust","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","gluteus_medius"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi au sol, le haut du dos contre un banc, la barre posée sur les hanches.","Monte les hanches jusqu'à ce que tes cuisses soient parallèles au sol.","Serre les fessiers en haut.","Redescends les hanches de façon contrôlée.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/hip-thrust/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/hip-thrust/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hip-thrust"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"2e454773-1ba1-5e37-bbe0-7568784b9c37","key":"hollow-body-hold","name_fr":"Hollow body hold","name_en":"Hollow Body Hold","aliases_fr":["Gainage en bateau"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"static-hold","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["hip_flexors","obliques","transverse_abdominis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos, bras tendus au-dessus de la tête et jambes tendues.","Plaque fermement le bas du dos contre le sol.","Lève légèrement les épaules, la tête et les jambes du sol.","Maintiens la position, bras et jambes tendus, le corps en forme de banane peu marquée.","Tiens pendant la durée prescrite."],"image_main":"/exercises/hollow-body-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hollow-body-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"5afe27ec-cef4-558b-b7e2-03b466f54daf","key":"horizontal-leg-press","name_fr":"Presse à cuisses horizontale","name_en":"Horizontal Leg Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"leg-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["leg_press"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi dans une presse à cuisses horizontale, le dos contre le pad et les pieds à largeur d'épaules sur la plateforme.","Pousse avec les pieds pour tendre les jambes, en t'arrêtant juste avant de verrouiller les genoux.","Fléchis les genoux de façon contrôlée pour les ramener vers la poitrine.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/horizontal-leg-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/horizontal-leg-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-horizontal-leg-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"52fa027b-004c-5e97-a8ab-a129093bd43b","key":"human-flag","name_fr":"Human flag","name_en":"Human Flag","aliases_fr":["Drapeau humain"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"static-hold","variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","obliques"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","gluteus_maximus","pectoralis_major","rectus_abdominis","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["calisthenics","core"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi près d'un poteau vertical solide.","Attrape le poteau en hauteur avec la main du haut (pronation) et plus bas avec la main du bas (supination).","Envoie les jambes vers le haut et vers l'extérieur en poussant fort avec le bras du bas contre le poteau.","Étends le corps à l'horizontale pour former une ligne droite parallèle au sol.","Maintiens la position, corps rigide, pendant la durée visée.","Redescends en contrôlant."],"image_main":"/exercises/human-flag/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-human-flag"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"da4b89ba-8be9-5f81-b3df-9c92cba50050","key":"hyperextension-hold-bench","name_fr":"Maintien extension lombaire au banc","name_en":"Hyperextension Bench Hold","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"back-extension","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["back"],"instructions_fr":["Règle le banc pour que le coussin soit juste sous le haut des hanches et que tes talons soient bien calés derrière le rouleau ou le coussin.","Croise les bras sur la poitrine et descends le buste vers le sol, le dos droit.","Remonte le buste jusqu'à ce que ton corps forme une ligne droite de la tête aux talons.","Arrête-toi dans cette ligne et tiens, les fessiers serrés et la nuque dans l'alignement de la colonne.","Respire lentement et ne cambre pas le bas du dos au-delà de la ligne droite pendant que tu tiens la durée prévue.","Redescends le buste de façon contrôlée et récupère."],"image_main":"/exercises/hyperextension-hold-bench/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-hyperextension-hold-bench"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"9ea63648-5fb6-5fdb-a0a1-f72327001612","key":"inchworm","name_fr":"Inchworm","name_en":"Inchworm","aliases_fr":["Marche de la chenille","Marche des mains vers planche"],"aliases_en":["Inchworm walkout"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","gastrocnemius","pectoralis_major","rectus_abdominis","serratus_anterior","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["full_body","core","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur de hanches.","Penche-toi en avant en charnière aux hanches et pose les mains au sol devant tes pieds, en fléchissant légèrement les genoux si besoin.","Avance les mains l'une après l'autre en gardant les jambes aussi tendues que possible confortablement, jusqu'à ce que ton corps soit en ligne droite près du sol.","Fléchis les coudes pour que la poitrine frôle le sol, comme en bas d'une pompe, et marque une courte pause en gainant le tronc.","Ramène les mains vers les pieds à petits pas en remontant les hanches, jusqu'à retrouver la position penchée en avant.","Redresse-toi, ou enchaîne directement sur la répétition suivante."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/inchworm/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/inchworm/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-inchworm","coory-inchworm-walkout"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"06807f0f-eb27-5dc0-99fa-4c2d95d1fb9c","key":"incline-bench-ez-bar-press","name_fr":"Développé incliné barre EZ","name_en":"Incline EZ-Bar Bench Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bench-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["ez_bar","bench"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push"],"instructions_fr":["Règle le banc entre 30 et 45 degrés. Prends la barre EZ avec les mains sur les parties inclinées.","Descends la barre vers le haut de la poitrine.","Repousse jusqu'à l'extension complète.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/incline-bench-ez-bar-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/incline-bench-ez-bar-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-incline-bench-ez-bar-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"331f43bb-8f2d-5063-8e44-a0b5b4abc7d5","key":"incline-bench-press","name_fr":"Développé incliné barre","name_en":"Incline Barbell Bench Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bench-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur un banc incliné entre 30 et 45 degrés.","Prends la barre un peu plus large que les épaules et décroche-la.","Descends la barre vers le haut de la poitrine.","Repousse la barre jusqu'à l'extension complète des bras.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/incline-bench-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/incline-bench-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-incline-bench-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"ef028a64-fcb5-57d1-bfaa-00dfbd33a59a","key":"incline-db-curl","name_fr":"Curl incliné haltères","name_en":"Incline Dumbbell Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["brachialis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi sur un banc incliné à 45 degrés, des haltères le long du corps.","Laisse les bras pendre droit, paumes vers l'avant.","Monte les haltères vers les épaules.","Redescends de façon contrôlée jusqu'à l'extension complète.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/incline-db-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/incline-db-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-incline-db-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"d3530154-c5bb-5ea7-a3fc-2747ab52fcdb","key":"incline-db-press","name_fr":"Développé incliné haltères","name_en":"Incline Dumbbell Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bench-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push"],"instructions_fr":["Règle le banc à 30 degrés et assieds-toi en arrière, les haltères à hauteur des épaules.","Pousse les haltères vers le haut en les rapprochant, jusqu'à l'extension complète des bras.","Redescends les haltères à hauteur des épaules de façon contrôlée.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/incline-db-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/incline-db-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-incline-db-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"c01b4415-4857-5282-b4c3-5957eaba2532","key":"incline-dumbbell-fly","name_fr":"Écarté incliné haltères","name_en":"Incline Dumbbell Fly","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"chest-fly","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","biceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur un banc incliné, haltères tenus au-dessus de la poitrine.","Pousse les haltères vers le haut, paumes face à face.","Garde les coudes légèrement fléchis tout au long du mouvement.","Descends les haltères en un large arc jusqu'à sentir un étirement des pectoraux.","Contracte les pectoraux pour ramener les haltères l'un vers l'autre.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/incline-dumbbell-fly/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/incline-dumbbell-fly/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-incline-dumbbell-fly"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"d30dd0de-24f9-5910-998d-6ab03617e64b","key":"incline-hammer-curl","name_fr":"Curl marteau incliné","name_en":"Incline Hammer Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","brachialis"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi sur un banc incliné avec des haltères en prise neutre.","Laisse les bras pendre droit.","Monte les haltères en mouvement de marteau.","Redescends lentement.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/incline-hammer-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/incline-hammer-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-incline-hammer-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"683e5cbc-8fe0-535a-b2db-5d3f7565dbd2","key":"incline-plank-hold","name_fr":"Planche inclinée (maintien)","name_en":"Incline Plank Hold","aliases_fr":["Planche sur banc"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"plank","variant_of":null,"equipment":["bench"],"primary_muscles":["rectus_abdominis","transverse_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","obliques","serratus_anterior"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Pose les avant-bras sur un banc plat, coudes juste sous les épaules.","Recule les pieds jusqu'à ce que le corps forme une ligne droite de la tête aux talons.","Serre les fessiers et rentre le nombril vers la colonne pour garder les hanches à niveau.","Garde la nuque allongée et regarde un point du banc un peu devant tes mains.","Tiens la position pendant le temps prévu en respirant régulièrement.","Rapproche les pieds pour terminer."],"image_main":"/exercises/incline-plank-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-incline-plank-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"4f9241fd-3385-5cdd-a2eb-b007e4a7bbe1","key":"incline-push-ups","name_fr":"Pompes inclinées","name_en":"Incline Push-Up","aliases_fr":["Pompes mains surélevées"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"push-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["bench"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Place les mains sur un banc ou une surface surélevée, à largeur d'épaules.","Tends les jambes derrière toi en position de planche.","Descends la poitrine vers le banc en fléchissant les coudes.","Repousse jusqu'à la position de départ.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/incline-push-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/incline-push-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-incline-push-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"7143516c-a21c-5b78-8031-abd83f7afe1e","key":"incline-treadmill-walk","name_fr":"Marche inclinée sur tapis","name_en":"Incline Treadmill Walk","aliases_fr":["Marche en pente sur tapis"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["cardio","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["treadmill"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","hamstrings","soleus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s","distance_m","speed_kmh","incline_pct"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["full_body","conditioning"],"instructions_fr":["Démarre le tapis à une vitesse de marche lente et monte dessus, puis augmente l'inclinaison jusqu'à la pente visée.","Marche avec une longue foulée appliquée, en déroulant du talon à la pointe et en repoussant le tapis derrière toi à chaque pas.","Tiens-toi droit et penche-toi depuis les chevilles avec la pente, sans te plier à la taille.","Garde toujours au moins un pied sur le tapis : marche dans la pente, ne te mets pas à trottiner.","Laisse les bras balancer naturellement, ou pose-les légèrement sur les rails pour l'équilibre sans y appuyer ton poids.","Tiens la pente pendant la durée voulue, puis baisse l'inclinaison et marche à plat quelques minutes pour terminer."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-incline-treadmill-walk"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"a2cb6fec-e83b-5715-867e-335d10ec5956","key":"inverted-row","name_fr":"Tractions australiennes","name_en":"Inverted Row","aliases_fr":["Rowing inversé"],"aliases_en":["Australian pull-up"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"row","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","rhomboids","trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","posterior_deltoid","rectus_abdominis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place une barre dans un rack à environ hauteur de taille.","Allonge-toi dessous et saisis la barre en pronation, un peu plus large que les épaules.","Reste suspendu, bras tendus, talons au sol, corps droit de la tête aux chevilles.","Tire la poitrine vers la barre en serrant les omoplates.","Redescends de façon contrôlée jusqu'à avoir les bras complètement tendus.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/inverted-row/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/inverted-row/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-inverted-row"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"f87f88e2-0456-581f-899c-920625d33f30","key":"isometric-neck-side","name_fr":"Flexion latérale du cou isométrique","name_en":"Isometric Neck Lateral Flexion","aliases_fr":["Isométrie latérale de la nuque"],"aliases_en":["Isometric neck side"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi ou tiens-toi bien droit. Pose la paume d'une main contre le côté de la tête, au-dessus de l'oreille.","Pousse la tête dans la main tout en résistant autant avec la main : la tête ne bouge pas.","Tiens la contraction isométrique pendant 5 à 10 secondes.","Relâche lentement, puis recommence du même côté pour toute la série.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":"/exercises/isometric-neck-side/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-isometric-neck-side"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"4b500a69-59b3-58c8-97db-019d31602b46","key":"isometric-split-squat","name_fr":"Split squat isométrique","name_en":"Isometric Split Squat","aliases_fr":["Maintien en fente","Maintien isométrique en fente"],"aliases_en":["Isometric split squat hold"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lunge","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Place un pied bien en avant et l'autre en arrière, à peu près un grand pas d'écart, les mains sur les hanches.","Garde le torse droit et descends à la verticale en fléchissant les deux genoux.","Descends jusqu'à ce que la cuisse avant soit presque parallèle au sol et que le genou arrière flotte juste au-dessus du sol.","Garde le talon avant à plat et le genou avant dans l'axe des orteils.","Tiens cette position pendant la durée prévue, tronc haut et poids réparti sur le pied avant.","Remonte, puis répète avec l'autre jambe."],"image_main":"/exercises/isometric-split-squat/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-isometric-split-squat","coory-isometric-split-squat-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"578c9195-a0ae-55fc-af6b-8a948bab5314","key":"jackknife-sit-up","name_fr":"Sit-up canif","name_en":"Jackknife Sit-Up","aliases_fr":["Jackknife sit-up","V-up"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["hip_flexors","obliques"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos, bras tendus au-dessus de la tête et jambes tendues.","Monte en même temps le buste et les jambes tendues du sol.","Amène les mains vers les pieds pendant que les pieds montent, pour vous rejoindre au-dessus des hanches.","Redescends le buste et les jambes au sol en contrôlant.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions recommandé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/jackknife-sit-up/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/jackknife-sit-up/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-jackknife-sit-up"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"7b3ff455-8aab-5b5a-973a-de5ca0710ba9","key":"jefferson-curl","name_fr":"Jefferson curl","name_en":"Jefferson Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell"],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi bien droit avec un haltère léger, bras tendus et pieds à peu près à largeur de hanches.","Rentre le menton et commence à arrondir la colonne depuis le haut, vertèbre par vertèbre.","Descends lentement en laissant la charge pendre et en gardant les jambes presque tendues.","Arrive en bas avec le dos complètement arrondi et un étirement dans les ischio-jambiers.","Inverse le mouvement en réempilant la colonne de bas en haut jusqu'à la position debout."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/jefferson-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/jefferson-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-jefferson-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"abb294ee-8f9a-527f-b9a5-8a19aa82a9e0","key":"jump-rope","name_fr":"Corde à sauter","name_en":"Jump Rope","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"active","disciplines":["cardio","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["jump_rope"],"primary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","soleus"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s","reps"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["full_body","conditioning"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens une poignée de corde dans chaque main, la corde derrière toi.","Fais passer la corde au-dessus de la tête et vers l'avant en un arc fluide.","Saute juste assez haut pour que la corde passe sous tes pieds.","Réceptionne-toi en douceur sur l'avant des pieds, genoux légèrement fléchis.","Garde un rythme régulier pendant l'intervalle prescrit."],"image_main":"/exercises/jump-rope/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-jump-rope"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"3833a411-996f-53cf-9b0d-415d46ae2907","key":"jump-squat","name_fr":"Squat sauté","name_en":"Jump Squat","aliases_fr":["Jump squat"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["legs","conditioning","plyometrics"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur d'épaules.","Descends en quart de squat, bras vers l'arrière.","Explose vers le haut en balançant les bras et saute aussi haut que possible.","Réceptionne-toi en douceur en quart de squat pour amortir l'impact.","Répète sans pause pour le nombre de répétitions prescrit."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/jump-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/jump-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-jump-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"3d56c2a8-582b-59a3-8e61-1db5b84cade9","key":"jumping-jacks","name_fr":"Jumping jacks","name_en":"Jumping Jacks","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"active","disciplines":["cardio","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","gluteus_medius","lateral_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["abductors","quadriceps","soleus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s","reps"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["full_body"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi droit, pieds joints et bras le long du corps.","Écarte les pieds en sautant et lève les bras au-dessus de la tête en même temps.","Fais en sorte que les mains se rejoignent ou presque au-dessus de la tête.","Rejoins les pieds en sautant tout en rabaissant les bras le long du corps.","Garde un mouvement continu et rythmé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/jumping-jacks/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/jumping-jacks/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-jumping-jacks"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"2b1b5728-bc3d-5974-b796-4abe6e983399","key":"kb-step-up-to-balance","name_fr":"Step-up avec équilibre kettlebells","name_en":"Kettlebell Step-Up to Balance","aliases_fr":["Step-up avec montée de genou kettlebells"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"step-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","gastrocnemius","gluteus_medius","hip_flexors"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi face à une marche ou un banc bas et stable, une kettlebell dans chaque main, bras le long du corps.","Pose un pied à plat sur la marche.","Pousse dans tout le pied avant et tends cette jambe pour monter sur la marche.","En montant, remonte l'autre genou devant toi jusqu'à ce que la cuisse soit à peu près à hauteur de hanche.","Tiens-toi droit sur la jambe de travail et maintiens le genou levé un instant, sans te pencher en arrière.","Redescends le pied libre au sol en contrôlant, puis redescends aussi la jambe de travail et recommence. Change de jambe après les répétitions prévues."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kb-step-up-to-balance/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kb-step-up-to-balance/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kb-step-up-to-balance"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"c665e0ef-b559-581a-922f-898dd4ebf1b7","key":"kettlebell-bottoms-up-hold","name_fr":"Maintien kettlebell bottoms-up","name_en":"Kettlebell Bottoms-Up Hold","aliases_fr":["Bottoms-up hold"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"overhead-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","forearm_flexors"],"secondary_muscles":["lateral_deltoid","obliques","serratus_anterior"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["shoulder_stability","grip"],"instructions_fr":["Épaule un kettlebell jusqu'à l'épaule et retourne-le pour que la cloche pointe vers le haut et que la poignée soit dans ton poing.","Tiens-toi debout, pieds à peu près à largeur d'épaules, le bras libre relâché le long du corps.","Garde l'avant-bras vertical et le coude près des côtes, la cloche juste au-dessus de ta main.","Serre fermement la poignée et garde le poignet droit, comme si tu équilibrais une tasse.","Tiens la cloche stable pendant la durée prévue, en respirant lentement et en gardant l'épaule basse.","Redescends le kettlebell de façon contrôlée, remets-le à l'endroit et change de bras."],"image_main":"/exercises/kettlebell-bottoms-up-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-bottoms-up-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"dedf40c7-b43b-51ea-b4f6-4fc4382ee9fd","key":"kettlebell-bulgarian-split-squat","name_fr":"Squat bulgare kettlebells","name_en":"Kettlebell Bulgarian Split Squat","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi dos à un banc, un pied posé dessus derrière toi, lacets vers le bas. Tiens un kettlebell dans chaque main le long du corps.","Garde le buste droit et gaine les abdominaux.","Descends en fléchissant les deux genoux, le genou avant dans l'axe des orteils.","Descends jusqu'à ce que la cuisse avant soit parallèle au sol ou un peu plus bas, genou arrière près du sol.","Pousse dans le talon avant pour revenir à la position de départ, en étendant les hanches et les genoux.","Fais toutes les répétitions de chaque côté avant de changer."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-bulgarian-split-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-bulgarian-split-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-bulgarian-split-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"981c52ef-c50e-5b1f-9d39-3c367ee87d53","key":"kettlebell-close-grip-floor-press","name_fr":"Floor press kettlebell prise serrée","name_en":"Kettlebell Close-Grip Floor Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"floor-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","pectoralis_major"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push","arms"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos au sol, genoux fléchis, pieds à plat.","Tiens une seule kettlebell par la poignée à deux mains, mains rapprochées, la kettlebell posée sur la poitrine, coudes bien collés aux côtes.","Gaine les abdominaux et pousse la kettlebell droit vers le haut jusqu'à tendre complètement les bras.","Redescends sous contrôle jusqu'à ce que les bras touchent le sol et marque une courte pause.","Repousse jusqu'au verrouillage.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions conseillé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-close-grip-floor-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-close-grip-floor-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-close-grip-floor-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"80c618e2-d2cd-5c9d-ab28-18bbecd36654","key":"kettlebell-concentration-curl","name_fr":"Curl concentré kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Concentration Curl","aliases_fr":["Concentration curl kettlebell"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["brachialis"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi sur un banc, pieds écartés, avec un kettlebell dans une main.","Cale l'arrière du haut du bras contre l'intérieur de la cuisse et laisse le kettlebell pendre.","Monte le kettlebell vers l'épaule en gardant le coude collé contre la jambe.","Contracte le biceps en haut, puis redescends lentement en contrôlant.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change de bras."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-concentration-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-concentration-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-concentration-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"e121cb54-38af-50bf-985d-86a14a01eb54","key":"kettlebell-curl","name_fr":"Curl kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["brachialis","brachioradialis","forearm_flexors"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","pull"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à peu près à largeur d'épaules, et tiens le kettlebell par la poignée à deux mains, devant les cuisses.","Garde les coudes près du corps, la poitrine haute et les épaules relâchées.","Fléchis les coudes et monte le kettlebell vers la poitrine sans laisser les bras partir vers l'avant.","Serre les biceps en haut, le kettlebell près de la poitrine.","Redescends le kettlebell lentement jusqu'à ce que les bras soient de nouveau tendus, en contrôlant le balancement.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"88ad116f-d36d-5cdd-be2d-98b99340db71","key":"kettlebell-curl-iso-hold","name_fr":"Curl kettlebell isométrique","name_en":"Kettlebell Curl Iso Hold","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","brachialis"],"secondary_muscles":["brachioradialis","forearm_flexors"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","pull"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à peu près à largeur d'épaules, et tiens le kettlebell par la poignée à deux mains, devant les cuisses.","Garde les coudes près du corps et les épaules relâchées.","Monte le kettlebell jusqu'à ce que tes avant-bras soient parallèles au sol et que les coudes soient fléchis à environ 90 degrés.","Arrête-toi là et tiens le kettlebell stable devant toi.","Garde les bras immobiles, la poitrine haute et la respiration lente pendant la durée prévue.","Redescends le kettlebell de façon contrôlée et récupère."],"image_main":"/exercises/kettlebell-curl-iso-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-curl-iso-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"aa58a048-b796-55c1-b926-fb0391b37214","key":"kettlebell-deadlift","name_fr":"Soulevé de terre kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Deadlift","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"deadlift","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur d'épaules, kettlebell entre les pieds.","Penche-toi en charnière de hanches et fléchis les genoux pour saisir la poignée.","Gaine les abdominaux et mets le dos à plat.","Pousse dans les talons pour te redresser avec la kettlebell.","Verrouille en haut, épaules en arrière.","Repose la kettlebell au sol avec contrôle."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-deadlift/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-deadlift/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-deadlift"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"df809454-b21c-5cfc-a7d1-1ee03f7fa4b9","key":"kettlebell-farmers-walk","name_fr":"Farmers carry kettlebells","name_en":"Kettlebell Farmer's Walk","aliases_fr":["Marche du fermier"],"aliases_en":["Farmer's carry"],"category":"hyrox","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength","hyrox"],"hyrox_station":6,"family":"cardio","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_maximus","quadriceps","rectus_abdominis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["distance_m","duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi entre deux kettlebells lourds.","Penche-toi à partir des hanches et attrape fermement les poignées en prise neutre.","Redresse-toi, épaules en arrière et abdominaux gainés.","Avance à petits pas contrôlés.","Garde une posture droite pendant toute la marche.","Pose les charges au sol à la fin de la distance."],"image_main":"/exercises/kettlebell-farmers-walk/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"coory","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-farmers-walk"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"5b8a79ac-849e-5a77-b5f3-b767439bc28a","key":"kettlebell-floor-press","name_fr":"Floor press kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Floor Press","aliases_fr":["Développé au sol kettlebell"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"floor-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos au sol, genoux fléchis, pieds à plat.","Tiens une kettlebell dans chaque main contre la poitrine, les kettlebells reposant sur l'extérieur des avant-bras.","Pousse les deux kettlebells droit vers le haut jusqu'à tendre complètement les bras.","Redescends sous contrôle jusqu'à ce que les triceps touchent le sol, sans rebondir.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions conseillé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-floor-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-floor-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-floor-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"6402cbde-0b58-59e0-ab29-b50dff4e14ec","key":"kettlebell-goblet-lunge","name_fr":"Fentes goblet kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Goblet Lunge","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":["Goblet lunge"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lunge","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi droit en tenant un kettlebell par les cornes à hauteur de poitrine, coudes rentrés, en position goblet.","Fais un pas contrôlé en avant avec une jambe, en descendant les hanches jusqu'à ce que les deux genoux soient fléchis à environ 90 degrés.","Veille à ce que le genou avant soit au-dessus de la cheville et que le genou arrière flotte juste au-dessus du sol.","Pousse dans le talon avant pour revenir à la position de départ, en gardant l'équilibre et les abdominaux gainés.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté avant de changer, ou alterne les jambes à chaque série."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-goblet-lunge/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-goblet-lunge/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-goblet-lunge"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"2817a8e9-5f6d-58ed-8111-dcde85056f5d","key":"kettlebell-halo","name_fr":"Halo kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Halo","aliases_fr":["Kettlebell halo"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["lateral_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["posterior_deltoid","trapezius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi bien droit, abdominaux gainés, avec un kettlebell léger tenu par les cornes (à l'envers) à hauteur de poitrine.","Amène le kettlebell d'un côté de la tête et fais-le passer derrière en cercle fluide.","Ramène-le à la position de départ devant le visage.","Change de sens toutes les quelques répétitions.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions ou la durée recommandé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-halo/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-halo/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-halo"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"90e31c2b-cccb-5ae2-8a8d-b03d7c3b2d44","key":"kettlebell-hammer-curl","name_fr":"Curl marteau kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Hammer Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","brachialis"],"secondary_muscles":["brachioradialis"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","pull"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout avec un kettlebell dans chaque main, poignées en position neutre (paumes face au corps).","Laisse les kettlebells pendre sous tes mains.","Garde les coudes collés au corps et monte les deux kettlebells vers les épaules.","Serre en haut, puis redescends de façon contrôlée.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-hammer-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-hammer-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-hammer-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"bb973604-77ec-5d0b-bf1c-a70b93ecf349","key":"kettlebell-hip-thrust","name_fr":"Hip thrust kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Hip Thrust","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"hip-thrust","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","glutes"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi au sol, le haut du dos contre un banc, genoux fléchis et pieds à plat.","Pose un kettlebell sur les hanches et tiens-le fermement à deux mains.","Pousse dans les talons et décolle les hanches du sol jusqu'à former une ligne droite des épaules aux genoux.","Serre fort les fessiers en haut du mouvement.","Redescends lentement les hanches jusqu'à la position de départ, de façon contrôlée."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-hip-thrust/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-hip-thrust/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-hip-thrust"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"a2712f9f-6127-52c5-91c8-42f5cacefbe0","key":"kettlebell-kickstand-deadlift","name_fr":"Soulevé de terre kickstand kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Kickstand Deadlift","aliases_fr":["Kickstand deadlift kettlebell"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"deadlift","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","erector_spinae"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","pull"],"instructions_fr":["Pose une kettlebell au sol à côté du pied avant et recule l'autre pied pour que seuls ses orteils touchent le sol.","Penche-toi en charnière de hanches, dos plat, et saisis la poignée de la kettlebell d'une main.","Pousse dans le talon avant et étends les hanches pour te redresser, kettlebell le long du corps.","Garde l'essentiel du poids sur le pied avant tout au long du mouvement.","Redescends en charnière en amenant la kettlebell vers le sol, dos plat. Change de côté après toutes les répétitions."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-kickstand-deadlift/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-kickstand-deadlift/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-kickstand-deadlift"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"83859303-e60b-59f6-8fb5-74df1598469e","key":"kettlebell-lunge-press","name_fr":"Fentes avec développé kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Lunge Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lunge","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings","rectus_abdominis","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens un kettlebell à hauteur d'épaule d'un seul bras.","Fais un pas en avant en fente avec la jambe opposée.","Pendant la fente, pousse le kettlebell au-dessus de la tête.","Verrouille le bras en haut du développé.","Reviens debout en reculant le pied, en redescendant le kettlebell.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-lunge-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-lunge-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-lunge-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"af48f18d-66a6-5bb8-b5c0-e16e3f96cc55","key":"kettlebell-offset-reverse-lunge-and-press","name_fr":"Fentes arrière développé kettlebell décalé","name_en":"Kettlebell Offset Reverse Lunge and Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lunge","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings","obliques","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens un kettlebell à hauteur d'épaule d'un seul côté.","Recule en fente arrière avec la jambe opposée.","Une fois en bas de la fente, pousse le kettlebell au-dessus de la tête.","Pousse dans le talon avant pour revenir debout.","Redescends le kettlebell à hauteur d'épaule.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-offset-reverse-lunge-and-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-offset-reverse-lunge-and-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-offset-reverse-lunge-and-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"47b17213-a5af-552e-b44c-7899dbd396d2","key":"kettlebell-overhead-carry","name_fr":"Overhead carry kettlebell à un bras","name_en":"Kettlebell Overhead Carry","aliases_fr":["Marche kettlebell au-dessus de la tête"],"aliases_en":["KB overhead carry"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","lateral_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_extensors","obliques","quadratus_lumborum","serratus_anterior","trapezius","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["distance_m","duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["shoulders","shoulder_stability","core","full_body"],"instructions_fr":["Épaule et presse un kettlebell jusqu'au verrouillage, en laissant la boule se poser sur l'arrière de l'avant-bras.","Tends complètement le coude et tourne le bras pour que le kettlebell soit derrière et au-dessus du poignet plutôt que sur le côté.","Garde l'épaule active : pousse la charge vers le plafond et laisse l'omoplate monter avec elle plutôt que de la forcer vers le bas.","Gaine le tronc et avance à pas réguliers, le kettlebell aligné au-dessus de l'épaule et de la hanche.","Garde le poignet droit : le laisser plier vers l'arrière rend le kettlebell instable au-dessus de la tête.","Marche sur la distance voulue, redescends en contrôlant, puis recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":"/exercises/kettlebell-overhead-carry/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-overhead-carry"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"04f711e2-36ef-5ea6-9850-9393c8eb95eb","key":"kettlebell-overhead-hold","name_fr":"Maintien kettlebell au-dessus de la tête","name_en":"Kettlebell Overhead Hold","aliases_fr":["Overhead hold"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"overhead-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","lateral_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["obliques","serratus_anterior","trapezius","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["shoulders","shoulder_stability"],"instructions_fr":["Épaule ou pousse un kettlebell pour avoir le bras tendu au-dessus de la tête, la cloche appuyée contre l'arrière de l'avant-bras.","Tiens-toi debout, pieds à peu près à largeur d'épaules, le bras libre relâché le long du corps.","Verrouille le coude et pousse la main vers le plafond, le haut du bras restant à côté de l'oreille.","Serre les fessiers et gaine les abdominaux pour que les côtes ne s'ouvrent pas et que le bas du dos reste neutre.","Tiens la cloche stable au-dessus de l'épaule pendant la durée prévue, en respirant lentement.","Redescends le kettlebell en position rack de façon contrôlée et change de bras."],"image_main":"/exercises/kettlebell-overhead-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-overhead-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"f6883c15-37ee-53b4-9c2d-597778d500da","key":"kettlebell-overhead-tricep-extension","name_fr":"Extension triceps kettlebell au-dessus de la tête","name_en":"Kettlebell Overhead Tricep Extension","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"overhead-tricep-extension","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","push"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout ou assis, une kettlebell tenue par les cornes (à l'envers) à deux mains au-dessus de la tête.","Bras en extension complète, kettlebell au-dessus de la tête.","Fléchis uniquement les coudes pour descendre la kettlebell derrière la tête en arc de cercle contrôlé.","Garde les bras verticaux et près de la tête : seuls les avant-bras bougent.","Tends les coudes pour ramener la kettlebell au-dessus de la tête.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-overhead-tricep-extension/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-overhead-tricep-extension/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-overhead-tricep-extension"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"c803a8de-4672-59a7-be02-8a2c22459ee9","key":"kettlebell-pistol-squat","name_fr":"Pistol squat kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Pistol Squat","aliases_fr":["Squat à une jambe kettlebell"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hamstrings","rectus_abdominis"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens un kettlebell contre la poitrine, à deux mains.","Tiens-toi sur une jambe, l'autre jambe tendue devant toi.","Descends les hanches en squat sur une jambe.","Garde la jambe levée décollée du sol pendant tout le mouvement.","Pousse dans le talon d'appui pour te relever.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change de côté."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-pistol-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-pistol-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-pistol-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"2759546f-7599-5b76-8ba9-033722ada88b","key":"kettlebell-pullover","name_fr":"Pull-over kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Pullover","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"pullover","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["serratus_anterior","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur un banc plat, une kettlebell tenue par les cornes à deux mains au-dessus de la poitrine, bras presque tendus (légère flexion des coudes).","En gardant l'angle des coudes fixe, descends la kettlebell derrière la tête en arc de cercle jusqu'à ce que les bras soient dans l'alignement du buste.","Ramène la kettlebell au-dessus de la poitrine sur le même arc.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-pullover/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-pullover/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-pullover"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"22ebbe03-bbd2-54c5-a7bb-5bcc57c062aa","key":"kettlebell-rack-hold","name_fr":"Maintien kettlebell en rack","name_en":"Kettlebell Rack Hold","aliases_fr":["Rack hold"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"overhead-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","forearm_flexors","obliques","trapezius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["shoulders"],"instructions_fr":["Épaule un kettlebell jusqu'à l'épaule pour que la cloche repose contre l'arrière de l'avant-bras et le haut du bras, la poignée dans la paume.","Tiens-toi debout, pieds à peu près à largeur d'épaules, le bras libre relâché le long du corps.","Garde le coude près des côtes et le poignet droit, pour que la cloche repose sur la poitrine et l'épaule, pas sur le poignet.","Tiens-toi bien droit, serre les fessiers et gaine les abdominaux sans te pencher à l'opposé de la cloche.","Tiens la position pendant la durée prévue, en respirant lentement.","Repose le kettlebell au sol de façon contrôlée et change de bras."],"image_main":"/exercises/kettlebell-rack-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-rack-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"99aebe73-807e-5fb7-82be-cfe04d8fe1c4","key":"kettlebell-reverse-lunge","name_fr":"Fentes arrière kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Reverse Lunge","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lunge","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hamstrings","obliques"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi droit en tenant un kettlebell par les cornes contre la poitrine, coudes rentrés (position goblet).","Recule une jambe en ligne droite et descends les hanches jusqu'à ce que les deux genoux soient fléchis à environ 90 degrés.","Garde le tibia avant vertical et la poitrine haute, le genou arrière flottant juste au-dessus du sol.","Pousse dans le talon avant pour revenir à la position de départ.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté avant de changer."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-reverse-lunge/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-reverse-lunge/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-reverse-lunge"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"609c5b0e-c72f-59e7-a1f2-ec98a4fc6b46","key":"kettlebell-reverse-wrist-curl","name_fr":"Curl poignets prise pronation kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Reverse Wrist Curl","aliases_fr":["Extension de poignets kettlebell"],"aliases_en":["KB reverse wrist curl"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["forearm_extensors"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","grip"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi sur un banc, avant-bras sur les cuisses, paumes vers le bas.","Tiens un kettlebell par la poignée à deux mains, poignets dépassant des genoux.","Laisse tomber les poignets en baissant le kettlebell.","Remonte le dos des mains en étendant les poignets.","Redescends en contrôlant et répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-reverse-wrist-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-reverse-wrist-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-reverse-wrist-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"0964dc36-d87a-5ce2-8c7a-01d1111ef025","key":"kettlebell-rotational-lunge","name_fr":"Fentes avec rotation kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Rotational Lunge","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lunge","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hamstrings","obliques"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens un kettlebell à deux mains contre la poitrine.","Recule en fente, en descendant jusqu'à ce que les deux genoux soient fléchis.","Tourne le torse vers la jambe avant.","Amène le kettlebell de ce côté, entre hauteur de poitrine et d'épaule, bras presque tendus.","Reviens au centre et pousse dans le pied avant pour revenir debout.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-rotational-lunge/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-rotational-lunge/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-rotational-lunge"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"34c4bf08-9471-5b37-a973-0ddde452ba3f","key":"kettlebell-russian-twist","name_fr":"Russian twist kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Russian Twist","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"crunch","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["obliques"],"secondary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi au sol, genoux fléchis, pieds décollés.","Tiens une kettlebell à deux mains devant la poitrine.","Penche-toi légèrement en arrière en gainant les abdominaux.","Pivote le buste d'un côté en amenant la kettlebell à côté de la hanche.","Pivote de l'autre côté de façon contrôlée.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-russian-twist/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-russian-twist/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-russian-twist"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"db8fbe7c-99aa-564a-b400-9fdef63e3b95","key":"kettlebell-shrug","name_fr":"Shrugs kettlebells","name_en":"Kettlebell Shrug","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"shrug","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi droit, pieds à largeur de hanches, un kettlebell dans chaque main, paumes face au corps.","Garde les bras tendus et les épaules relâchées.","Hausse les épaules à la verticale vers les oreilles en serrant les trapèzes en haut.","Maintiens brièvement la contraction.","Redescends lentement les épaules à la position de départ de façon contrôlée.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-shrug/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-shrug/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-shrug"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"b79897af-315a-5a86-aee5-38c3f2061607","key":"kettlebell-single-leg-deadlift","name_fr":"Soulevé de terre à une jambe kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Single Leg Deadlift","aliases_fr":["Soulevé de terre unilatéral kettlebell"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"deadlift","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_medius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens une kettlebell dans une main et tiens-toi sur la jambe opposée.","Penche-toi en charnière de hanche et descends la kettlebell vers le sol.","Envoie la jambe libre tendue vers l'arrière pour l'équilibre.","Descends jusqu'à ce que le buste soit parallèle au sol.","Pousse dans le talon de la jambe d'appui pour te redresser.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-single-leg-deadlift/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-single-leg-deadlift/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-single-leg-deadlift"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"f0c28971-b11d-5265-b2ed-1caf1ca29a77","key":"kettlebell-skull-crusher","name_fr":"Barre au front kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Skull Crusher","aliases_fr":["Skull crusher kettlebell"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"skull-crusher","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","push"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos au sol, genoux fléchis et pieds à plat, un kettlebell tenu par les anses à deux mains, bras tendus au-dessus de la poitrine.","Fléchis les coudes pour descendre le kettlebell en arc contrôlé, au-delà du front puis derrière la tête, jusqu'à presque toucher le sol.","Garde les bras immobiles, inclinés légèrement vers l'arrière en direction de la tête : seuls les avant-bras bougent.","Tends les coudes pour repousser le kettlebell vers le haut.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions recommandé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-skull-crusher/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-skull-crusher/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-skull-crusher"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"3203062b-174c-59bb-ac09-cb89ba5cc775","key":"kettlebell-squat","name_fr":"Squat kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Squat","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","glutes"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur d'épaules, un kettlebell tenu à deux mains devant toi.","Laisse le kettlebell pendre naturellement entre tes jambes en gainant les abdominaux.","Fléchis les hanches et les genoux pour descendre, en gardant le kettlebell près du corps.","Pousse dans les pieds pour te relever jusqu'à la position de départ.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"91b1a947-8a65-52d3-b668-c9771eff5c01","key":"kettlebell-sumo-deadlift","name_fr":"Soulevé de terre sumo kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Sumo Deadlift","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"deadlift","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","erector_spinae","hamstrings","trapezius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","pull"],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi en écart large, pointes de pieds légèrement ouvertes, une kettlebell au sol entre les pieds.","Descends en charnière, dos plat, genoux dans l'axe des orteils, et saisis la poignée à deux mains.","Pousse contre le sol et étends ensemble hanches et genoux pour te redresser.","Contracte les fessiers en haut.","Repose la kettlebell au sol sous contrôle en poussant les hanches vers l'arrière.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions conseillé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-sumo-deadlift/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-sumo-deadlift/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-sumo-deadlift"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"3af9047d-7813-5e28-b5d8-4e3a093c32d0","key":"kettlebell-sumo-high-pull","name_fr":"Tirage haut sumo kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Sumo High Pull","aliases_fr":["Sumo high pull kettlebell"],"aliases_en":["KB sumo high pull"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["adductors","lateral_deltoid","trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings","posterior_deltoid"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds plus larges que les épaules, pointes légèrement tournées vers l'extérieur, un kettlebell au sol entre les pieds.","Descends en charnière et attrape la poignée à deux mains.","Pousse dans les pieds et étends explosivement les hanches pour monter le kettlebell.","Pendant qu'il monte, remonte les coudes vers le haut et l'extérieur jusqu'à ce que la poignée arrive à hauteur du menton.","Redescends le kettlebell entre les jambes en contrôlant.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions recommandé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-sumo-high-pull/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-sumo-high-pull/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-sumo-high-pull"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"84ef2587-9b92-5327-b858-b6664bf3ca23","key":"kettlebell-svend-press","name_fr":"Svend press kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Svend Press","aliases_fr":["Squeeze press kettlebell"],"aliases_en":["KB Svend press"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push","chest"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout avec un kettlebell tenu par la poignée à deux mains à hauteur de poitrine, la boule pendant sous tes mains.","Serre les mains l'une contre l'autre sur la poignée pour contracter les pectoraux.","Pousse le kettlebell vers l'avant jusqu'à avoir les bras presque tendus.","Ramène-le vers la poitrine en contrôlant.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-svend-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-svend-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-svend-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"1fc8f0a4-9996-58e5-9cdb-a3c954f80d47","key":"kettlebell-swing","name_fr":"Kettlebell swing","name_en":"Kettlebell Swing","aliases_fr":["Swing"],"aliases_en":["KB swing"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"kettlebell-swing","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur d'épaules, le kettlebell au sol devant toi.","Pars des hanches, attrape le kettlebell et fais-le passer vers l'arrière entre tes jambes.","Projette les hanches vers l'avant de façon explosive pour envoyer le kettlebell à hauteur de poitrine.","Laisse le kettlebell revenir entre tes jambes.","Répète en un mouvement fluide."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-swing/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-swing/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-swing"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"70b09395-9f34-5307-bf98-e2aefc768a08","key":"kettlebell-swing-clean","name_fr":"Swing clean kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Swing Clean","aliases_fr":["Kettlebell clean"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"clean","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","erector_spinae","trapezius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["olympic_lifting"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur d'épaules, kettlebell entre les pieds.","Penche-toi en charnière de hanches et saisis la poignée d'une main.","Balance la kettlebell vers l'arrière entre tes jambes.","Pousse les hanches vers l'avant pour monter la kettlebell jusqu'à l'épaule.","Réceptionne la kettlebell en position rack sur l'épaule.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-swing-clean/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-swing-clean/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-swing-clean"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"e0ad5297-4e95-572d-a8a5-71430a60d5bc","key":"kettlebell-tibialis-raise","name_fr":"Relevé de pointes de pied kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Tibialis Raise","aliases_fr":["Tibialis raise"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"calf-raise","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["tibialis_anterior"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi au bout d'un banc plat, une jambe tendue et le talon posé au sol.","Accroche un kettlebell par la poignée sur le dessus du pied, au niveau des orteils.","Relève les orteils vers le tibia aussi haut que tu le peux, le talon restant au sol.","Marque une courte pause en haut.","Redescends le pied lentement jusqu'à ce que les orteils pointent vers le sol.","Fais toutes les répétitions, puis change de jambe."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-tibialis-raise/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-tibialis-raise/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-tibialis-raise"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"be6607d8-7617-5842-bd3a-2d61cb38cb6b","key":"kettlebell-turkish-get-ups","name_fr":"Turkish get-up kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Turkish Get Ups","aliases_fr":["Relevé turc"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"turkish-get-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","gluteus_maximus","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["obliques","quadriceps","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos, une kettlebell tenue bras tendu au-dessus de toi dans une main.","Fléchis le genou du même côté et pose le pied à plat.","Redresse-toi sur le coude opposé, puis sur la main.","Monte les hanches et ramène la jambe tendue en arrière jusqu'à une fente.","Mets-toi complètement debout en gardant la kettlebell verrouillée au-dessus de la tête.","Fais le chemin inverse pour revenir à la position de départ."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-turkish-get-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-turkish-get-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-turkish-get-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"7d64a398-10a3-53f8-83a0-4c578f0b391e","key":"kettlebell-windmills","name_fr":"Windmill kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Windmills","aliases_fr":["Moulin à vent kettlebell"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"turkish-get-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["adductors","anterior_deltoid","obliques"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, une kettlebell verrouillée bras tendu au-dessus de la tête dans une main.","Tourne les pieds d'environ 45 degrés à l'opposé du bras qui travaille.","Garde la kettlebell en haut et incline le buste sur le côté en charnière de hanches.","Descends la main opposée vers ton pied.","Pousse les hanches en arrière pour te redresser complètement.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-windmills/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-windmills/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-windmills"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"94fa2adb-1226-5020-8a0f-18c317a9c1b4","key":"kettlebell-wrist-curl","name_fr":"Curl poignets kettlebell","name_en":"Kettlebell Wrist Curl","aliases_fr":["Flexion de poignets kettlebell"],"aliases_en":["KB wrist curl"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["forearm_flexors"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","grip"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi sur un banc, avant-bras sur les cuisses, paumes vers le haut.","Tiens un kettlebell par la poignée dans chaque main, poignets dépassant des genoux.","Laisse les kettlebells basculer vers le bout des doigts.","Remonte-les en fléchissant les poignets, en contrôlant le poids décentré.","Redescends en contrôlant et répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kettlebell-wrist-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kettlebell-wrist-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kettlebell-wrist-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"6e2d9b9e-5604-51a7-8ef0-1eacfbc97e19","key":"knee-push-ups","name_fr":"Pompes sur les genoux","name_en":"Knee Push Ups","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"push-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","rectus_abdominis","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi en position de pompe, genoux au sol.","Place les mains au sol à largeur d'épaules.","Garde le corps aligné des genoux aux épaules.","Descends la poitrine vers le sol en fléchissant les coudes.","Repousse avec les mains pour revenir à la position de départ.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/knee-push-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/knee-push-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-knee-push-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"fe7c0020-ef55-5926-b73e-1708c70b5df6","key":"knee-to-chest-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement genou à la poitrine","name_en":"Knee-to-Chest Stretch","aliases_fr":["Genou poitrine"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos, les deux jambes tendues.","Ramène un genou et serre-le contre ta poitrine avec les deux mains.","Garde l'autre jambe relâchée au sol.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-knee-to-chest-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
