{"id":"aab831e4-e4b9-5105-853d-d7a2d2c6f348","key":"kneeling-cable-row","name_fr":"Tirage horizontal à genoux à la poulie","name_en":"Kneeling Cable Row","aliases_fr":["Rowing à genoux à la poulie"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["cable"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","posterior_deltoid","rhomboids","trapezius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Règle une poulie à peu près à hauteur de poitrine et fixe une corde ou une poignée double-D.","Mets-toi à genoux, buste droit, face à la machine et assez loin pour que les plaques ne touchent pas le fond.","Attrape la poignée à deux mains et tiens-la devant toi à hauteur de poitrine.","Tire la poignée vers le sternum en ramenant les coudes vers l'arrière et en serrant les omoplates.","Reviens en contrôlant jusqu'à la position de départ, bras étirés.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions recommandé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/kneeling-cable-row/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/kneeling-cable-row/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kneeling-cable-row"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"2da50d5f-282d-55c8-8d1a-3eda8e068148","key":"kneeling-hip-flexor-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement fléchisseurs de hanche à genoux","name_en":"Kneeling Hip Flexor Stretch","aliases_fr":["Étirement psoas chevalier"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi sur un genou, l'autre pied à plat devant.","Garde le buste droit et les abdominaux légèrement gainés.","Pousse les hanches vers l'avant jusqu'à sentir l'étirement à l'avant de la hanche arrière.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kneeling-hip-flexor-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"568cef73-fc82-5c2d-b331-1ba69e1a2c19","key":"kneeling-wrist-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement poignets à genoux","name_en":"Kneeling Wrist Stretch","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["forearm_flexors"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi à quatre pattes et pose les paumes à plat au sol.","Tourne les mains pour que les doigts pointent vers tes genoux.","Garde les paumes au sol et recule doucement le poids du corps.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-kneeling-wrist-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"f6326a8d-f75a-543c-9072-8f6a20e73d66","key":"l-sit","name_fr":"L-sit","name_en":"L Sit","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"static-hold","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dip_station"],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","quadriceps","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi au sol ou pousse sur des barres parallèles, bras tendus.","Verrouille les coudes et abaisse les épaules.","Lève les jambes tendues devant toi, parallèles au sol.","Forme un L avec ton corps.","Maintiens la position pendant la durée prescrite.","Redescends les jambes en contrôlant pour sortir de la position."],"image_main":"/exercises/l-sit/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-l-sit"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
