{"id":"ff79d0a8-b7bb-55b9-ae4b-3b9fae721b62","key":"landmine-single-arm-overhead-hold","name_fr":"Maintien landmine overhead à un bras","name_en":"Landmine Single-Arm Overhead Hold","aliases_fr":["Landmine overhead hold"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell","landmine"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["obliques","pectoralis_major","serratus_anterior","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["shoulders","shoulder_stability","push"],"instructions_fr":["Cale une extrémité d'une barre dans un support landmine ou dans un coin, et place-toi face à l'extrémité libre en fente décalée, pieds à peu près à largeur d'épaules.","Tiens l'extrémité de la barre d'une main à l'épaule, l'autre main sur la hanche.","Pousse la barre vers le haut et l'avant jusqu'à avoir le bras tendu et la main au-dessus et un peu devant l'épaule.","Verrouille le coude et pousse l'omoplate autour des côtes sans hausser les épaules.","Tiens la barre stable pendant la durée prévue, tronc gainé pour ne pas pencher sur le côté.","Redescends la barre à l'épaule en contrôlant et change de bras."],"image_main":"/exercises/landmine-single-arm-overhead-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-landmine-single-arm-overhead-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"bbbbc5e4-5f2c-5142-ac06-bc101cd46244","key":"lat-pulldown","name_fr":"Tirage vertical","name_en":"Lat Pulldown","aliases_fr":["Tirage poitrine"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"pull-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["cable"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","posterior_deltoid","rhomboids"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi à la machine de tirage vertical, cuisses calées sous les coussins.","Prends la barre large en pronation.","Tire la barre vers le haut de la poitrine en contractant les dorsaux.","Remonte lentement la barre en position de départ.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/lat-pulldown/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/lat-pulldown/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-lat-pulldown"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"0c690d72-1898-56bd-88cd-a25e8532766c","key":"lateral-leg-swing","name_fr":"Balancés de jambe latéraux","name_en":"Lateral Leg Swing","aliases_fr":["Leg swings latéraux","Balancements de jambe latéraux"],"aliases_en":["Side leg swing","Dynamic leg swings lateral"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility","warmup","running"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"leg-swing","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["abductors","adductors"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hip_flexors"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi droit et gaine le tronc, en t'aidant d'un support stable si besoin.","Transfère le poids sur une jambe et décolle légèrement l'autre pied du sol.","Balance la jambe libre devant le corps, en travers.","Inverse le mouvement et envoie-la sur le côté, sur une amplitude confortable.","Continue de façon fluide, puis change de jambe."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-lateral-leg-swing","coory-dynamic-leg-swings-lateral"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
