{"id":"fa3760c7-ac2d-534d-8bbe-3446491c6042","key":"single-leg-romanian-deadlift","name_fr":"Soulevé de terre roumain à une jambe haltères","name_en":"Single Leg Romanian Deadlift","aliases_fr":["SDT roumain unilatéral"],"aliases_en":["Single leg RDL"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"deadlift","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_medius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi sur une jambe, un haltère dans chaque main devant les cuisses.","Garde le genou d'appui légèrement fléchi.","Penche-toi en charnière de hanche en étendant la jambe libre derrière toi.","Descends les haltères le long de la jambe d'appui jusqu'à sentir un étirement des ischio-jambiers.","Pousse dans le talon pour te redresser.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/single-leg-romanian-deadlift/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/single-leg-romanian-deadlift/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-single-leg-romanian-deadlift"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"97dcdcaf-ff40-5207-b220-02b8d4c87920","key":"sit-ups","name_fr":"Sit-up","name_en":"Sit-Ups","aliases_fr":["Relevé de buste"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"crunch","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["obliques"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos, genoux fléchis, pieds bloqués.","Croise les bras sur la poitrine ou place les mains derrière la tête.","Relève-toi complètement jusqu'à ce que le buste soit à la verticale.","Redescends avec contrôle.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/sit-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/sit-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-sit-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"5a50485e-4f3f-590a-8d60-d7d10d1e29ce","key":"six-inch-hold","name_fr":"Six inch hold","name_en":"Six Inch Hold","aliases_fr":["Gainage 15 cm"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"static-hold","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["obliques","quadriceps","transverse_abdominis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos, jambes tendues et bras le long du corps.","Plaque le bas du dos au sol et gaine les abdominaux.","Lève la tête, les épaules et les jambes tendues d'environ 15 cm du sol.","Maintiens la position en respirant régulièrement.","Redescends lentement pour te reposer."],"image_main":"/exercises/six-inch-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-six-inch-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"9d067da6-31ce-58a6-95a7-c3d1c66c93fb","key":"ski-erg","name_fr":"SkiErg","name_en":"SkiErg","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":["Ski erg"],"category":"hyrox","visibility":"active","disciplines":["cardio","hyrox"],"hyrox_station":1,"family":"cardio","variant_of":null,"equipment":["ski_erg"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","rectus_abdominis","triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["distance_m","duration_s","calories_kcal","pace_s_per_500m"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["conditioning","full_body"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi face au SkiErg, les poignées au-dessus de la tête et les pieds à peu près à largeur de hanches.","Gaine le tronc et descends les poignées en tirant avec les dorsaux, en te penchant légèrement à partir des hanches.","Termine avec les mains près des cuisses et les genoux légèrement fléchis.","Laisse les câbles se rétracter pendant que tu remontes les bras au-dessus de la tête et te redresses.","Répète de façon fluide, en gardant les talons au sol et le buste contrôlé."],"image_main":"/exercises/ski-erg/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"coory","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-ski-erg"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
