{"id":"91342544-fd9a-5bd8-9ba1-60532ac0f6a6","key":"sphinx-pose","name_fr":"Posture du sphinx","name_en":"Sphinx Pose","aliases_fr":["Salamba Bhujangasana"],"aliases_en":["Salamba Bhujangasana"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae"],"secondary_muscles":["hip_flexors","pectoralis_major"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le ventre et pose les avant-bras au sol, coudes à l'aplomb des épaules.","Appuie les avant-bras et le dessus des pieds au sol, et lève la poitrine.","Éloigne les épaules des oreilles et allonge l'arrière de la nuque.","Tiens la position le temps prévu, en respirant vers l'avant de la poitrine.","Redescends la poitrine au sol et relâche."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-sphinx-pose"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"6cf7e17a-bee2-51f8-a76a-701d1f46c5a2","key":"spider-curl","name_fr":"Spider curl","name_en":"Spider Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["brachialis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi face au banc incliné, les bras pendant droit.","Tiens un haltère dans chaque main en supination.","Garde le haut des bras à la verticale pendant que tu montes les haltères.","Serre fort les biceps en haut.","Redescends les haltères de façon contrôlée jusqu'à l'extension complète.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/spider-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/spider-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-spider-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"62ad2961-99a2-57e4-a149-506eb5a61525","key":"spiderman-push-up","name_fr":"Pompes Spiderman","name_en":"Spiderman Push-Up","aliases_fr":["Spiderman push-ups"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"push-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major","triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","hip_flexors","obliques","rectus_abdominis","serratus_anterior"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["push","calisthenics","core"],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi en planche haute, mains un peu plus larges que les épaules et corps aligné.","Commence à descendre la poitrine vers le sol en décollant en même temps un pied du sol.","Amène ce genou vers l'extérieur et vers le haut jusqu'au coude du même côté, en gardant les hanches basses.","Repousse jusqu'à la planche en ramenant la jambe en position de départ.","Répète de l'autre côté et continue d'alterner."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/spiderman-push-up/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/spiderman-push-up/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-spiderman-push-up"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"f7b1eb0f-e7b2-5223-9c9f-7c9cb26e8766","key":"split-jerk","name_fr":"Split jerk","name_en":"Split Jerk","aliases_fr":["Jeté fendu"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"jerk","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","trapezius","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["olympic_lifting"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens la barre en rack avant, coudes hauts.","Fais une flexion bien verticale en fléchissant légèrement les genoux.","Projette la barre au-dessus de la tête de façon explosive avec les jambes et les bras.","Écarte les pieds, un devant et un derrière, pendant que la barre se verrouille.","Redresse-toi en ramenant les pieds l'un vers l'autre sous la barre.","Redescends la barre et répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/split-jerk/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/split-jerk/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-split-jerk"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"1f18e43e-a02d-5577-859e-fc7811b8b98d","key":"split-squat","name_fr":"Split squat","name_en":"Split Squat","aliases_fr":["Squat fendu"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lunge","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi en position fendue, un pied devant et un pied derrière.","Garde le torse droit et les abdominaux gainés.","Descends les hanches à la verticale en fléchissant les deux genoux.","Arrête-toi quand le genou arrière est juste au-dessus du sol.","Pousse dans le talon avant pour revenir au départ.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/split-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/split-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-split-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"dc12b7b0-7b5e-524a-a295-44cebeae716d","key":"spoto-press","name_fr":"Spoto press","name_en":"Spoto Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bench-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur un banc plat et prends la barre un peu plus large que les épaules.","Décroche la barre et tiens-la au-dessus de la poitrine, bras tendus.","Descends la barre jusqu'à environ 2,5 cm au-dessus de la poitrine.","Marque une pause d'une seconde pleine sans toucher la poitrine.","Repousse la barre jusqu'à ce que les bras soient tendus.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/spoto-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/spoto-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-spoto-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"23bb6605-e34b-5e09-a775-823e52f1ef10","key":"squat","name_fr":"Back squat","name_en":"Barbell Back Squat","aliases_fr":["Squat barre","Squat arrière"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["powerlifting","legs"],"instructions_fr":["Place la barre sur le haut des trapèzes.","Décroche la barre et recule d'un pas, pieds à largeur d'épaules.","Gaine les abdominaux et descends jusqu'à ce que les cuisses soient parallèles au sol.","Pousse dans les talons pour te relever.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"13008df2-8af4-571d-b473-2b9af6c0c770","key":"squat-hold","name_fr":"Squat isométrique","name_en":"Squat Hold","aliases_fr":["Maintien en squat"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","erector_spinae","gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur d'épaules et pointes légèrement tournées vers l'extérieur.","Tends les bras devant toi pour t'équilibrer.","Descends en squat jusqu'à ce que les cuisses soient parallèles au sol, poitrine haute et talons au sol.","Maintiens la position, genoux dans l'axe des pointes de pieds.","Remonte pour terminer."],"image_main":"/exercises/squat-hold/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-squat-hold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"024de54a-f07a-567a-a330-13c5521375b2","key":"squat-pulse","name_fr":"Squat pulsé","name_en":"Squat Pulse","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à peu près à largeur d'épaules et pointes légèrement tournées vers l'extérieur, bras tendus devant toi pour l'équilibre.","Descends en squat jusqu'à ce que les cuisses soient au moins parallèles au sol, poitrine haute et talons au sol.","Depuis le bas, remonte seulement de quelques centimètres, puis redescends.","Continue les pulsations dans la partie basse, sans verrouiller ni te reposer en haut.","Remonte complètement à la fin de la série."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/squat-pulse/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/squat-pulse/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-squat-pulse"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"341318f1-5c07-5657-ab42-ea5253463c31","key":"stability-ball-hip-bridge","name_fr":"Pont fessier sur ballon de stabilité","name_en":"Stability Ball Hip Bridge","aliases_fr":["Hip bridge sur swiss ball"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["stability_ball"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings","rectus_abdominis"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos au sol et pose les deux pieds sur un ballon de stabilité.","Les bras reposent au sol le long du corps pour l'équilibre.","Contracte les fessiers et pousse les talons dans le ballon pour monter les hanches.","Termine avec une ligne droite des épaules aux genoux.","Redescends les hanches en contrôlant, sans que le ballon ne roule.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions recommandé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/stability-ball-hip-bridge/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/stability-ball-hip-bridge/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-stability-ball-hip-bridge"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"40dc9692-2bf8-5f15-a84b-1459e6a74e64","key":"stability-ball-knee-tuck","name_fr":"Knee tuck sur ballon de stabilité","name_en":"Stability Ball Knee Tuck","aliases_fr":["Knee tuck sur swiss ball"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["stability_ball"],"primary_muscles":["rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","hip_flexors","obliques","serratus_anterior"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Pars en planche haute avec les deux tibias ou le dessus des pieds posés sur un ballon de stabilité.","Les mains sont sous les épaules, le corps en ligne droite.","Gaine les abdominaux et ramène le ballon vers la poitrine en fléchissant les genoux.","Repousse-le en étendant complètement les jambes jusqu'à la position de planche.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions recommandé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/stability-ball-knee-tuck/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/stability-ball-knee-tuck/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-stability-ball-knee-tuck"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"13e94db2-186c-5fff-af19-74034126eec4","key":"stability-ball-push-up","name_fr":"Pompes sur ballon de stabilité (pieds)","name_en":"Stability Ball Push-Up","aliases_fr":["Pompes pieds sur swiss ball"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"push-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["stability_ball"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","rectus_abdominis","serratus_anterior","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push","calisthenics","core"],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi à genoux devant un ballon de stabilité et pose les tibias ou les pieds dessus.","Place les mains au sol sous les épaules, en planche haute.","Gaine fortement les abdominaux : le ballon va chercher à rouler sur le côté.","Descends la poitrine vers le sol en fléchissant les coudes.","Repousse jusqu'à la position de départ sans laisser le ballon bouger.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/stability-ball-push-up/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/stability-ball-push-up/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-stability-ball-push-up"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"e0e072ee-9c1c-55a0-ac40-fa8a9c42d522","key":"stability-ball-push-up-hands-on-ball","name_fr":"Pompes sur ballon de stabilité (mains)","name_en":"Stability Ball Push-Up (Hands on Ball)","aliases_fr":["Pompes mains sur swiss ball"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"push-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["stability_ball"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","rectus_abdominis","serratus_anterior","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push","calisthenics","core"],"instructions_fr":["Pose les deux mains sur un ballon de stabilité et recule les pieds en planche bras tendus, corps aligné de la tête aux talons.","Gaine les abdominaux et garde le ballon stable sous tes mains.","Fléchis les coudes pour descendre la poitrine vers le ballon en contrôlant.","Repousse jusqu'à l'extension complète des bras sans laisser rouler le ballon.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/stability-ball-push-up-hands-on-ball/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/stability-ball-push-up-hands-on-ball/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-stability-ball-push-up-hands-on-ball"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"270e2ea2-a938-51ea-9521-f5495461a2d3","key":"stability-ball-wall-squat","name_fr":"Squat au mur sur ballon de stabilité","name_en":"Stability Ball Wall Squat","aliases_fr":["Wall squat sur ballon"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["stability_ball"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Place un ballon de stabilité entre le bas du dos et un mur.","Avance les pieds d'environ 30 cm, un peu plus larges que les épaules.","Descends en squat en laissant le ballon rouler le long du dos.","Arrête-toi quand les cuisses sont parallèles au sol.","Pousse dans les talons pour te redresser."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/stability-ball-wall-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/stability-ball-wall-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-stability-ball-wall-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"68b42206-99b1-5e77-845d-1a5fd4172846","key":"stair-climber","name_fr":"Stair climber","name_en":"Stair Climber","aliases_fr":["Simulateur d'escaliers"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"active","disciplines":["cardio"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["stair_climber"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","gluteus_medius","hamstrings","soleus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s","distance_m","calories_kcal"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["conditioning","legs","glutes"],"instructions_fr":["Monte sur la marche du bas avec la machine à sa vitesse la plus lente et tiens les rampes légèrement pour l'équilibre.","Monte une marche à la fois, en posant tout le pied sur chaque marche et pas seulement les orteils.","Tiens-toi droit, poitrine ouverte et hanches sous les épaules, sans te voûter sur la console.","Pousse la marche vers le bas par le talon du pied avant, en laissant le fessier de cette jambe travailler.","Règle l'allure pour garder ta posture, et continue de monter pendant la durée ou le nombre d'étages voulu."],"image_main":"/exercises/stair-climber/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-stair-climber"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"b7e22dd3-ab1e-5a7f-86e8-b44918428201","key":"standing-adductor-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement adducteurs debout","name_en":"Standing Adductor Stretch","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":["Side lunge stretch"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["adductors"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds écartés d'environ deux fois la largeur d'épaules et orteils vers l'avant.","Pose les mains sur le genou plié ou devant toi pour te soutenir.","Plie un genou et déplace les hanches sur le côté au-dessus de cette jambe, l'autre jambe restant tendue.","Garde la poitrine haute et les deux pieds à plat au sol.","Descends jusqu'à sentir un étirement le long de l'intérieur de la cuisse de la jambe tendue et tiens la position.","Passe de l'autre côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-standing-adductor-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"479a2880-3055-5739-b1b5-3322f2ac536e","key":"standing-calf-raise","name_fr":"Extension des mollets debout","name_en":"Standing Calf Raise","aliases_fr":["Mollets debout"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"calf-raise","variant_of":null,"equipment":["standing_calf_raise_machine"],"primary_muscles":["gastrocnemius"],"secondary_muscles":["soleus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout au bord d'une plateforme ou dans la machine à mollets.","Descends les talons sous la plateforme.","Monte sur la pointe des pieds.","Redescends lentement.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/standing-calf-raise/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/standing-calf-raise/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-standing-calf-raise"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"95485a08-af96-5e2e-ac9b-1698282c9d84","key":"standing-calf-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement mollets debout","name_en":"Standing Calf Stretch","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gastrocnemius"],"secondary_muscles":["soleus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Recule un pied en position fente décalée.","Garde la jambe arrière tendue et le talon appuyé au sol.","Plie le genou avant et penche ton poids vers l'avant.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-standing-calf-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"3879e887-8cd0-573d-bcfb-800e1d496c92","key":"standing-forward-fold","name_fr":"Flexion avant debout","name_en":"Standing Forward Fold","aliases_fr":["Pince debout","Uttanasana"],"aliases_en":["Uttanasana"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gastrocnemius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur de hanches et jambes tendues.","Plie aux hanches et descends le buste vers le sol.","Laisse les mains et la tête pendre vers tes pieds.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-standing-forward-fold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"bda52337-5b66-5707-9c18-105b0121ef68","key":"standing-forward-fold-to-half-lift","name_fr":"Flexion avant debout vers demi-relevé","name_en":"Standing Forward Fold to Half Lift","aliases_fr":["Ardha Uttanasana"],"aliases_en":["Half lift"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur de hanches, et penche-toi en avant en pliant aux hanches.","Pose les mains sur les tibias, au sol ou sur des blocs.","Fais glisser les mains le long des tibias et relève la poitrine jusqu'à avoir le dos plat et la colonne longue.","Redescends en pliant et laisse la tête et la nuque se relâcher.","Continue d'alterner entre les deux positions pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-standing-forward-fold-to-half-lift"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"9577dece-4b89-563d-a1a7-977f188927c7","key":"standing-hip-abduction","name_fr":"Abduction de hanche debout","name_en":"Standing Hip Abduction","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"hip-abduction","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["abductors","gluteus_medius"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadratus_lumborum"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["legs","glutes"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi bien droit, mains sur les hanches, pieds proches l'un de l'autre.","Reporte ton poids sur une jambe en gardant ce genou légèrement fléchi.","Lève l'autre jambe tendue sur le côté, orteils vers l'avant et buste droit.","Lève la jambe seulement aussi haut que possible sans pencher le haut du corps du côté opposé.","Redescends lentement la jambe à côté du pied d'appui.","Fais les répétitions prévues, puis recommence avec l'autre jambe."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/standing-hip-abduction/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/standing-hip-abduction/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-standing-hip-abduction"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
