{"id":"d4dc2e2b-35ae-503d-8c7b-72932afd9eb7","key":"standing-quad-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement quadriceps debout","name_en":"Standing Quad Stretch","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["hip_flexors"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi sur une jambe, en t'aidant d'un mur pour l'équilibre si besoin.","Plie l'autre genou et attrape cette cheville derrière toi.","Tire le talon vers le fessier, genoux joints.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-standing-quad-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"fcc213ca-999d-5a8e-aa39-ce5af8b07d68","key":"standing-side-bend","name_fr":"Inclinaison latérale debout","name_en":"Standing Side Bend","aliases_fr":["Flexion latérale debout"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["obliques"],"secondary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","quadratus_lumborum"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur de hanches, et lève les deux bras au-dessus de la tête.","Joins les mains et grandis-toi.","Incline-toi doucement d'un côté en formant une longue courbe.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-standing-side-bend"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"d3c637ce-215f-508e-bc49-89921f4fb3d3","key":"standing-side-bend-flow","name_fr":"Inclinaisons latérales debout dynamiques","name_en":"Standing Side Bend Flow","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["obliques"],"secondary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","quadratus_lumborum"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur de hanches, et lève les deux bras au-dessus de la tête.","Incline le buste d'un côté, les deux pieds bien ancrés et les hanches à niveau.","Reviens par le centre, les côtes empilées au-dessus du bassin.","Incline-toi de l'autre côté de la même façon.","Continue d'alterner pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-standing-side-bend-flow"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"b0a118b0-dfd1-5428-8b92-b31b7fb2712e","key":"standing-split","name_fr":"Grand écart debout","name_en":"Standing Split","aliases_fr":["Urdhva Prasarita Eka Padasana"],"aliases_en":["Standing splits"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Depuis une flexion avant, pose les deux mains au sol ou sur des blocs à côté du pied d'appui.","Transfère le poids sur une jambe et lève l'autre jambe derrière toi.","Garde la jambe d'appui tendue et les hanches aussi à niveau que la hauteur de jambe le permet.","Tiens la position le temps prévu, en rapprochant la poitrine du tibia d'appui.","Repose le pied levé et recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-standing-split"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"9c2849dd-cdf5-5f01-bc8d-d8b3a0359cdc","key":"stationary-bike","name_fr":"Vélo d'appartement","name_en":"Stationary Bike","aliases_fr":["Vélo stationnaire"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"active","disciplines":["cardio"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["stationary_bike"],"primary_muscles":["quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","gluteus_maximus","hamstrings","soleus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s","distance_m","calories_kcal"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["conditioning","legs"],"instructions_fr":["Règle la hauteur de selle pour que ton genou reste légèrement fléchi en bas de la poussée, puis assieds-toi et pose l'avant des pieds sur les pédales.","Prends le guidon avec une prise relâchée et assieds-toi bien droit, dos neutre et épaules basses.","Pousse une pédale vers le bas et l'avant pendant que l'autre remonte, en gardant l'effort dans les jambes plutôt qu'en tirant sur le guidon.","Continue de pédaler en un cercle fluide et régulier à cadence constante, en respirant au rythme du mouvement.","Ajuste la résistance pour tenir l'effort visé, et continue pendant la durée ou la distance voulue."],"image_main":"/exercises/stationary-bike/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-stationary-bike"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"de573e76-334c-54e0-bf56-9f7a89579461","key":"step-up-to-balance","name_fr":"Step-up avec équilibre","name_en":"Step-Up to Balance","aliases_fr":["Step-up avec montée de genou"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"step-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["bench"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","gluteus_medius","hip_flexors"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi face à une marche ou un banc bas et stable, et pose un pied à plat dessus.","Pousse dans tout le pied avant et tends cette jambe pour monter sur la marche.","En montant, remonte l'autre genou devant toi jusqu'à ce que la cuisse soit à peu près à hauteur de hanche.","Tiens-toi droit sur la jambe de travail et maintiens le genou levé un instant, sans te pencher en arrière.","Redescends le pied libre au sol en contrôlant, puis redescends aussi la jambe de travail.","Fais les répétitions prévues sur une jambe, puis change de jambe."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/step-up-to-balance/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/step-up-to-balance/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-step-up-to-balance"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"a65b3e64-e7df-55fc-89b7-d805135de08e","key":"step-ups","name_fr":"Step-up","name_en":"Step Ups","aliases_fr":["Montée sur box"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"step-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["bench"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi face à un box ou un banc solide.","Pose un pied entièrement sur le dessus du box.","Pousse dans ce talon pour monter sur le box.","Amène l'autre pied pour te tenir complètement debout sur le box.","Redescends en commençant par le même pied.","Alterne les jambes ou fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté avant de changer."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/step-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/step-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-step-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"2645bb62-2ae6-5886-8949-c9d6df24768a","key":"stiff-leg-deadlift","name_fr":"Soulevé de terre jambes tendues","name_en":"Stiff Leg Deadlift","aliases_fr":["SDT jambes tendues"],"aliases_en":["Stiff-legged deadlift"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"deadlift","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","trapezius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à largeur de hanches, penche-toi en charnière de hanches, jambes presque tendues, et tiens une barre bas devant les tibias, dos plat.","Garde les jambes presque tendues, avec seulement une légère flexion des genoux tout au long.","Pousse les hanches vers l'avant et redresse-toi, la barre glissant le long des jambes.","Penche-toi de nouveau en charnière et redescends la barre le long des jambes.","Descends aussi bas que ta souplesse des ischio-jambiers le permet, dos plat.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/stiff-leg-deadlift/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/stiff-leg-deadlift/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-stiff-leg-deadlift"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"dc516054-e02a-5ff1-b0ea-459416ae8df8","key":"straight-arm-pulldown","name_fr":"Tirage bras tendus à la poulie","name_en":"Straight-Arm Pulldown","aliases_fr":["Pull-over poulie haute"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"pullover","variant_of":null,"equipment":["cable"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["posterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi face à une poulie, une barre droite fixée à la poulie haute.","Bras presque tendus, pousse la barre vers le bas en arc de cercle vers tes cuisses.","Contracte les dorsaux en bas.","Remonte lentement la barre en position de départ.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/straight-arm-pulldown/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/straight-arm-pulldown/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-straight-arm-pulldown"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"09a8c1ad-179a-598c-a33d-c21133aabb6f","key":"straight-bar-cable-front-raise","name_fr":"Élévations frontales à la poulie barre droite","name_en":"Straight-Bar Cable Front Raise","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"front-raise","variant_of":null,"equipment":["cable"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid"],"secondary_muscles":["lateral_deltoid","pectoralis_major"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Fixe une barre droite à une poulie basse et place-toi dos à la machine, le câble passant devant tes jambes.","Saisis la barre en pronation, mains à peu près à largeur d'épaules, bras pendants tendus devant les cuisses.","Garde les coudes presque tendus et les abdominaux gainés pour que le buste ne se penche pas en arrière.","Lève la barre vers l'avant en un arc fluide jusqu'à hauteur d'épaules.","Redescends-la sous contrôle jusqu'aux cuisses et répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/straight-bar-cable-front-raise/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/straight-bar-cable-front-raise/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-straight-bar-cable-front-raise"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"1fac4533-7cad-5b2d-bdac-5310cb1060fc","key":"straight-bar-dips","name_fr":"Dips à la barre droite","name_en":"Straight Bar Dips","aliases_fr":["Dips sur barre"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"dips","variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Saisis une barre droite en pronation, un peu plus large que les épaules, et saute en appui bras tendus au-dessus, la barre au niveau des hanches.","Penche légèrement la poitrine vers l'avant et fléchis les coudes pour descendre vers la barre, coudes pointés vers l'arrière.","Arrête-toi quand la barre est proche du haut de la poitrine, ou au point le plus bas que tu contrôles.","Pousse sur la barre pour tendre les bras et revenir en appui.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/straight-bar-dips/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/straight-bar-dips/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-straight-bar-dips"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"5c6321ae-40ea-51b0-ae38-b99f387651bc","key":"strict-curl","name_fr":"Curl strict","name_en":"Strict Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["brachialis","forearm_flexors"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi bien droit avec un haltère dans chaque main, les bras le long du corps, paumes vers l'avant.","Colle les coudes contre les côtes et gaine les abdominaux pour que le buste ne se balance pas.","Monte les deux haltères en ne fléchissant que les coudes.","Redescends-les de façon contrôlée jusqu'à avoir les bras tendus.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/strict-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/strict-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-strict-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"77844178-da05-5ecd-bd04-1efa6f1a238e","key":"suitcase-carry","name_fr":"Suitcase carry","name_en":"Suitcase Carry","aliases_fr":["Marche de la valise","Marche valise unilatérale"],"aliases_en":["Single arm suitcase carry"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["kettlebell"],"primary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","obliques","quadratus_lumborum"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_medius","quadriceps","trapezius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["distance_m","duration_s","load_kg"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core","grip","full_body"],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi à côté d'un kettlebell ou d'un haltère, pieds sous les hanches.","Charnière aux hanches, prends la poignée d'une main et relève-toi avec la charge qui pend le long du corps.","Descends et recule cette épaule, et gaine comme si on allait te pousser de côté.","Avance avec des pas normaux et réguliers, buste droit et face à l'avant plutôt qu'incliné à l'opposé de la charge.","Garde le bras libre relâché le long du corps au lieu de le tendre comme contrepoids.","Marche sur la distance ou la durée voulue, repose la charge en contrôlant, puis recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":"/exercises/suitcase-carry/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-suitcase-carry","coory-single-arm-suitcase-carry"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"f0357b9d-ca83-552e-8dd7-7297a10742aa","key":"sumo-deadlift","name_fr":"Soulevé de terre sumo","name_en":"Sumo Deadlift","aliases_fr":["SDT sumo"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"deadlift","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["powerlifting","legs"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds plus larges que les épaules, pointes de pieds ouvertes.","Saisis la barre entre tes jambes.","Gaine les abdominaux et pousse dans les talons pour te redresser.","Redescends sous contrôle.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/sumo-deadlift/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/sumo-deadlift/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-sumo-deadlift"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"009cde43-7aa8-56a0-a1fe-d8f3a1ba9403","key":"sumo-squat","name_fr":"Squat sumo barre","name_en":"Sumo Squat","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds plus larges que les épaules et pointes tournées vers l'extérieur.","Tiens une barre sur le haut du dos.","Gaine les abdominaux et garde la poitrine haute.","Fléchis les hanches et les genoux pour descendre en squat profond.","Pousse dans les talons pour te redresser.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/sumo-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/sumo-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-sumo-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"848d82aa-df86-5985-9406-afa1368bfe2c","key":"superman","name_fr":"Superman","name_en":"Superman","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"back-extension","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi face au sol, les bras tendus au-dessus de la tête.","Soulève en même temps les bras, la poitrine et les jambes du sol.","Tiens brièvement en haut.","Redescends de façon contrôlée.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/superman/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/superman/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-superman"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"0b0ebf04-4b8f-59fc-8d8a-033ea75c71e8","key":"supine-spinal-twist","name_fr":"Torsion allongée de la colonne","name_en":"Supine Spinal Twist","aliases_fr":["Torsion allongée"],"aliases_en":["Supine twist","Lying spinal twist"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","obliques"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos et ramène un genou vers ta poitrine.","Guide ce genou en travers de ton corps vers le sol.","Écarte largement les bras et tourne la tête du côté opposé.","Tiens la position 20 à 30 secondes en respirant calmement.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-supine-spinal-twist"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"1cfefab6-250b-563d-a056-7207e0a5d5c4","key":"supine-windshield-wipers","name_fr":"Essuie-glaces allongé","name_en":"Supine Windshield Wipers","aliases_fr":["Windshield wipers"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["obliques","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["hip_flexors","transverse_abdominis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos, bras écartés sur les côtés et genoux fléchis au-dessus des hanches.","Gaine le tronc pour que le bas du dos ne décolle pas du sol.","Descends les deux jambes ensemble d'un côté, aussi loin que les épaules restent au sol.","Ramène-les par le centre et descends de l'autre côté.","Continue d'alterner pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/supine-windshield-wipers/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/supine-windshield-wipers/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-supine-windshield-wipers"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"a9268b7c-3d87-5cc1-b193-6dfc69581d1c","key":"supported-shoulderstand","name_fr":"Chandelle avec appui","name_en":"Supported Shoulderstand","aliases_fr":["Supported shoulderstand","Salamba Sarvangasana"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","trapezius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos, idéalement avec une couverture pliée sous les épaules et la tête en dehors.","Lève les jambes au-dessus de la tête et soutiens le bas du dos avec les deux mains, coudes à largeur d'épaules.","Remonte les mains le long du dos et empile les hanches au-dessus des épaules jusqu'à ce que le corps soit vertical.","Tiens la position pendant la durée prévue, tête et nuque complètement immobiles.","Redescends les jambes au-dessus de la tête et déroule lentement le dos, les mains soutenant le dos."],"image_main":"/exercises/supported-shoulderstand/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-supported-shoulderstand"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"817648de-09c4-5d1a-9200-40829bb9d048","key":"supported-single-leg-stand","name_fr":"Équilibre unipodal avec appui","name_en":"Supported Single-Leg Stand","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"static-hold","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","gluteus_medius"],"secondary_muscles":["hip_flexors","soleus","tibialis_anterior"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi droit à côté d'une chaise solide, d'un mur ou d'une rampe, une main posée légèrement dessus.","Transfère ton poids sur la jambe la plus proche de l'appui et garde ce genou souple.","Lève l'autre genou devant toi jusqu'à ce que la cuisse soit à peu près à hauteur de hanche.","Garde la poitrine haute, les hanches de niveau et le regard fixé sur un point devant toi.","Maintiens la position pendant la durée prévue, en utilisant l'appui seulement autant que nécessaire.","Repose le pied, récupère brièvement et recommence sur l'autre jambe."],"image_main":"/exercises/supported-single-leg-stand/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-supported-single-leg-stand"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"27bc243d-3a50-58ec-a597-8e02e9fd5bbe","key":"svend-press","name_fr":"Svend press","name_en":"Svend Press","aliases_fr":["Squeeze press"],"aliases_en":["Plate svend press"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["plates"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi bien droit avec un seul disque (ou deux collés) tenu entre les paumes à hauteur de poitrine.","Serre fort les disques pour générer de la tension dans les pectoraux.","Pousse les disques droit devant toi jusqu'à avoir les bras complètement tendus.","Marque une courte pause en gardant la pression, puis ramène les disques vers la poitrine.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions recommandé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/svend-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/svend-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-svend-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"dec079d7-e1c4-5f06-ba33-c8a974e7ff6c","key":"t-bar-row","name_fr":"Rowing T-bar","name_en":"T-Bar Row","aliases_fr":["Rowing barre en T"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"row","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","rhomboids"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","erector_spinae","trapezius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi à califourchon au-dessus de la T-bar chargée, pieds à largeur d'épaules.","Penche le buste en partant des hanches jusqu'à environ 45 degrés.","Saisis les poignées et garde le dos plat.","Tire la barre vers ta poitrine en emmenant les coudes vers l'arrière.","Serre les omoplates en haut.","Redescends la barre de façon contrôlée et répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/t-bar-row/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/t-bar-row/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-t-bar-row"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"3707025c-c489-5251-b332-2e28248a4934","key":"tandem-stance","name_fr":"Position en tandem","name_en":"Tandem Stance","aliases_fr":["Tandem stance"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"static-hold","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","soleus"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","tibialis_anterior"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi droit, pieds joints et bras écartés sur les côtés à hauteur d'épaules.","Avance un pied et pose-le directement devant l'autre, talon contre pointe.","Répartis ton poids de façon égale sur les deux pieds et garde les genoux souples.","Regarde un point fixe devant toi et garde les hanches et les épaules de niveau.","Maintiens la position pendant la durée prévue, en utilisant les bras pour corriger les petits déséquilibres.","Change le pied avant et recommence."],"image_main":"/exercises/tandem-stance/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-tandem-stance"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"650c5d48-c903-5a7e-82fc-06b00eb0aa51","key":"thoracic-bridge","name_fr":"Pont thoracique","name_en":"Thoracic Bridge","aliases_fr":["Thoracic bridge"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["posterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi au sol, genoux fléchis et mains derrière toi, doigts vers l'arrière.","Appuie dans les mains et les pieds pour décoller les hanches du sol.","Continue de pousser jusqu'à ouvrir la poitrine et tendre les bras.","Laisse la tête partir vers l'arrière et tiens la position.","Respire régulièrement en gardant le pont.","Redescends en contrôlant."],"image_main":"/exercises/thoracic-bridge/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-thoracic-bridge"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
