{"id":"8caf71df-fbf9-5932-83e7-650a42c17296","key":"thread-the-needle","name_fr":"Thread the needle","name_en":"Thread the Needle","aliases_fr":["Passage du fil dans l'aiguille"],"aliases_en":["Parsva Balasana"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["posterior_deltoid","trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","obliques"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi à quatre pattes, mains sous les épaules et genoux sous les hanches.","Fais glisser un bras sous le corps, paume vers le haut, jusqu'à poser l'épaule et le côté de la tête sur le tapis.","Garde les hanches au-dessus des genoux et avance la main du dessus ou passe-la derrière le dos.","Tiens la torsion le temps prévu, en respirant vers le haut du dos.","Appuie la main du dessus au sol pour remonter et recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-thread-the-needle"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"fd594fa5-f884-5552-9e18-b81761f0a26c","key":"thread-the-needle-flow","name_fr":"Thread the needle dynamique","name_en":"Thread the Needle Flow","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["obliques","trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","posterior_deltoid"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi à quatre pattes, mains sous les épaules et genoux sous les hanches.","Fais glisser un bras sous le corps jusqu'à ce que l'épaule approche du tapis.","Inverse le mouvement et ouvre ce bras vers le plafond, en suivant la main des yeux.","Reviens par le centre et répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu.","Change de côté et recommence."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-thread-the-needle-flow"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"09211220-300d-56bf-8de2-b9c73dabd49e","key":"three-legged-dog","name_fr":"Chien à trois jambes","name_en":"Three-Legged Downward Dog","aliases_fr":["Three-legged dog"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","gluteus_maximus"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings","trapezius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi en chien tête en bas, mains à largeur d'épaules et hanches hautes.","Appuie les deux mains uniformément dans le sol et déplace légèrement le poids vers l'avant.","Lève une jambe derrière toi jusqu'à l'aligner avec la colonne, en gardant les deux hanches à la même hauteur.","Tiens la position pendant la durée prévue, talon d'appui qui cherche le sol.","Redescends la jambe et recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":"/exercises/three-legged-dog/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-three-legged-dog"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"5fbf84ad-e3a9-5908-a4d6-fe4750c3e2c1","key":"thruster","name_fr":"Thruster","name_en":"Thruster","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"overhead-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","trapezius","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens une barre en position rack avant, coudes hauts.","Place les pieds à largeur d'épaules.","Descends en squat jusqu'à la parallèle en gardant le buste droit.","Remonte du squat et envoie la barre au-dessus de la tête dans un seul mouvement.","Verrouille les bras en haut, barre au-dessus de la tête.","Ramène la barre en position rack avant et répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/thruster/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/thruster/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-thruster"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"1e66fe58-fe37-5607-9355-285191dbd612","key":"toes-to-bar","name_fr":"Toes to bar","name_en":"Toes to Bar","aliases_fr":["Pieds à la barre"],"aliases_en":["T2B"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["forearm_flexors","latissimus_dorsi","obliques"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Suspends-toi à une barre de traction en prise pronation, bras complètement tendus et corps immobile.","Contracte les dorsaux et les abdominaux pour éviter de balancer.","Monte les jambes genoux tendus en amenant les orteils vers la barre.","Touche la barre avec les orteils, puis redescends les jambes en contrôlant.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/toes-to-bar/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/toes-to-bar/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-toes-to-bar"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"95041585-2307-5e32-99d7-8d0b8345dcef","key":"torso-twists","name_fr":"Rotations du buste","name_en":"Torso Twists","aliases_fr":["Rotations du tronc"],"aliases_en":["Standing torso rotation"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["obliques","transverse_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à peu près à largeur d'épaules et genoux légèrement fléchis.","Gaine légèrement les abdominaux et joins les mains devant la poitrine.","Tourne la cage thoracique d'un côté sans bouger les pieds.","Reviens par le centre et tourne de l'autre côté.","Continue d'alterner de façon fluide, dans une amplitude confortable."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-torso-twists"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"a75fa2a5-b5b1-563f-a887-782b42c581b1","key":"treadmill-running","name_fr":"Course sur tapis","name_en":"Treadmill Running","aliases_fr":["Tapis de course"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["cardio","running"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["treadmill"],"primary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings","hip_flexors","soleus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["distance_m","duration_s","pace_s_per_km","speed_kmh","incline_pct"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["full_body","conditioning"],"instructions_fr":["Place un pied de chaque côté du tapis sur les rebords, lance le tapis à vitesse de marche et monte dessus une fois qu'il bouge.","Monte jusqu'à ton allure de course, en posant le pied sous les hanches sans aller le chercher devant toi.","Cours grand, épaules relâchées, coudes fléchis à environ 90 degrés et bras qui balancent d'avant en arrière, pas en travers du corps.","Garde le regard devant toi et reste au milieu du tapis sans dériver vers le rouleau arrière.","Tiens l'allure pendant la durée ou la distance voulue, puis ralentis le tapis et marche quelques minutes avant de descendre."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-treadmill-running"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"8e8d27c8-79ac-5aa7-be65-971a7f9ef003","key":"tree-pose","name_fr":"Posture de l'arbre","name_en":"Tree Pose","aliases_fr":["Tree pose","Vrksasana"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","soleus"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi bien droit et transfère le poids sur un pied.","Pose la plante de l'autre pied sur l'intérieur du mollet ou de la cuisse, en évitant le genou.","Presse le pied et la jambe l'un contre l'autre et mets les hanches à niveau.","Amène les mains devant la poitrine ou au-dessus de la tête et tiens la posture pendant la durée prévue.","Repose le pied et recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":"/exercises/tree-pose/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-tree-pose"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"3863b208-71e1-563a-b257-3c49ed17d262","key":"triangle-pose","name_fr":"Posture du triangle","name_en":"Triangle Pose","aliases_fr":["Trikonasana"],"aliases_en":["Trikonasana"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hamstrings","obliques"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","gluteus_medius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout jambes écartées, le pied avant tourné vers l'extérieur et le pied arrière légèrement tourné vers l'intérieur.","Garde les deux jambes tendues et tends la main avant vers l'avant pendant que les hanches reculent.","Incline-toi sur le côté et amène la main du bas sur le tibia, un bloc ou le sol, le bras du haut tendu vers le plafond.","Tiens la position le temps prévu, en tournant la poitrine vers le plafond.","Pousse sur les pieds pour remonter et recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-triangle-pose"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"42a91271-584b-5713-be0c-0f228cfe8ca3","key":"tricep-kickback","name_fr":"Kickback triceps haltères","name_en":"Dumbbell Tricep Kickback","aliases_fr":["Extension triceps buste penché haltères"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"tricep-kickback","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell"],"primary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms"],"instructions_fr":["Penche le buste vers l'avant en charnière de hanches, un haltère dans chaque main, coudes fléchis à 90 degrés.","Étends les deux bras vers l'arrière en serrant les triceps.","Marque une courte pause en extension complète.","Redescends en contrôlant.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/tricep-kickback/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/tricep-kickback/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-tricep-kickback"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"bd8ea083-acf7-5187-82dc-c9b615d0f61c","key":"tricep-pushdown","name_fr":"Extension triceps à la poulie barre droite","name_en":"Cable Tricep Pushdown","aliases_fr":["Pushdown triceps"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"tricep-pushdown","variant_of":null,"equipment":["cable"],"primary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms"],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi face à une poulie haute équipée d'une barre droite.","Attrape la barre et colle les coudes contre tes flancs.","Pousse la barre vers le bas jusqu'à avoir les bras complètement tendus.","Reviens lentement à la position de départ.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/tricep-pushdown/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/tricep-pushdown/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-tricep-pushdown"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"187751cd-2d2a-58c9-a193-9249c96167b3","key":"triceps-dip-hold-bars","name_fr":"Maintien dips triceps aux barres","name_en":"Triceps Dip Hold on Dip Bars","aliases_fr":["Maintien dips aux barres parallèles"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"dips","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dip_station"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major","triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push","arms","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Saisis les barres parallèles d'une station de dips, pousse et tends les bras, épaules basses, loin des oreilles.","Penche-toi légèrement en avant, jambes serrées, et croise les pieds derrière toi si tu veux.","Descends lentement en fléchissant les coudes jusqu'à ce que les bras soient à peu près parallèles au sol.","Arrête-toi là et maintiens, coudes vers l'arrière et poitrine ouverte.","Garde les épaules basses et le corps stable pendant le maintien pour le temps prévu.","Remonte bras tendus et redescends au sol."],"image_main":"/exercises/triceps-dip-hold-bars/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-triceps-dip-hold-bars"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"4ddd24ef-3ac8-59e3-a9cd-ac5a56e7ccdf","key":"triceps-dip-hold-bench","name_fr":"Maintien dips triceps sur banc","name_en":"Triceps Dip Hold on Bench","aliases_fr":["Maintien dips sur banc"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"dips","variant_of":null,"equipment":["bench"],"primary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","pectoralis_major"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["arms"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi au bord d'un banc, place les mains à côté des hanches, doigts vers l'avant, et avance les pieds pour que les jambes soient tendues.","Fais glisser les hanches hors du banc et tends les bras pour porter ton poids.","Descends en fléchissant les coudes jusqu'à environ 90 degrés, dos près du banc.","Arrête-toi là et maintiens, coudes pointés droit vers l'arrière et poitrine ouverte.","Garde les épaules basses, loin des oreilles, pendant le maintien pour le temps prévu.","Remonte bras tendus et rassieds-toi."],"image_main":"/exercises/triceps-dip-hold-bench/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-triceps-dip-hold-bench"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"ceaf6637-4294-514c-9fc7-9339987d736a","key":"trx-bicep-curl","name_fr":"Curl biceps TRX","name_en":"TRX Bicep Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["brachialis","brachioradialis"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","pull","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Règle les sangles du TRX à une longueur moyenne.","Tiens-toi face à l'ancrage, prends les poignées en supination et penche-toi en arrière jusqu'à avoir les bras tendus.","Garde le corps droit et les abdominaux gainés, puis tire la poitrine vers tes mains en fléchissant les coudes.","Serre les biceps en haut du mouvement.","Étends lentement les bras pour revenir à la position de départ, en contrôlant la descente.","Garde la tension tout au long de la série."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/trx-bicep-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/trx-bicep-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-bicep-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"1bbaef39-e085-5005-b14d-d60bd6490633","key":"trx-chest-press","name_fr":"Développé pectoraux TRX","name_en":"TRX Chest Press","aliases_fr":["Pompes TRX"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bench-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","rectus_abdominis","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Règle les poignées du TRX à hauteur de mi-mollet.","Tiens-toi dos à l'ancrage, une poignée dans chaque main, bras tendus.","Penche-toi vers l'avant en position de planche, le corps droit de la tête aux talons.","Descends la poitrine vers tes mains en fléchissant les coudes, en gardant les sangles tendues.","Repousse jusqu'à la position de départ, bras tendus, en serrant les pectoraux."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/trx-chest-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/trx-chest-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-chest-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"1cd31fe5-3162-5266-ab09-94b183147b6d","key":"trx-face-pull","name_fr":"Face pull TRX","name_en":"TRX Face Pull","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"reverse-fly","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["posterior_deltoid","rhomboids"],"secondary_muscles":["trapezius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull","calisthenics","shoulder_stability"],"instructions_fr":["Saisis les poignées du TRX en pronation, paumes vers le bas.","Penche-toi en arrière jusqu'à avoir les bras complètement tendus et le corps bien aligné.","Tire les poignées vers ton visage en emmenant les coudes hauts et écartés.","Serre les omoplates l'une vers l'autre au point de contraction maximale.","Tends lentement les bras pour revenir à la position de départ de façon contrôlée."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/trx-face-pull/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/trx-face-pull/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-face-pull"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"d9f56997-e2be-59ee-b5e9-cbbde7dd77cb","key":"trx-hamstring-curl","name_fr":"Leg curl TRX","name_en":"TRX Hamstring Curl","aliases_fr":["Curl ischio TRX"],"aliases_en":["Suspension hamstring curl"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"leg-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","gluteus_maximus"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos, talons dans les étriers du TRX, genoux fléchis à 90 degrés.","Décolle les hanches du sol pour former une ligne droite des genoux aux épaules.","Tends les jambes vers l'avant en gardant les hanches hautes et les abdominaux gainés.","Ramène les talons vers les fessiers en contractant fort les ischio-jambiers.","Contrôle le mouvement et ne laisse pas tes hanches descendre pendant toute la série."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/trx-hamstring-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/trx-hamstring-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-hamstring-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"f4afbbe7-d14c-597f-af7a-f3761041d768","key":"trx-lunge","name_fr":"Fentes TRX","name_en":"TRX Lunge","aliases_fr":["Fentes arrière TRX"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lunge","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi dos au point d'ancrage, les sangles du TRX derrière toi, mains sur les hanches ou libres pour l'équilibre.","Place le dessus d'un pied dans l'étrier et tends cette jambe derrière toi.","Gaine les abdominaux et descends en fléchissant le genou avant, torse droit.","Descends jusqu'à ce que la cuisse avant soit parallèle au sol ou un peu en dessous, en gardant la tension sur le TRX.","Pousse dans le talon avant pour revenir à la position de départ, en tendant la jambe avant.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté, puis change de jambe et répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/trx-lunge/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/trx-lunge/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-lunge"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"8c906847-5ed2-592d-bc13-08d8690cdd0e","key":"trx-pistol-squat","name_fr":"Pistol squat TRX","name_en":"TRX Pistol Squat","aliases_fr":["Squat à une jambe TRX"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Fixe le TRX et tiens les poignées à deux mains, bras tendus.","Tiens-toi droit, lève une jambe tendue devant toi, sans la poser au sol.","Lance le mouvement en poussant les hanches en arrière et en fléchissant le genou de la jambe d'appui, descends aussi bas que possible.","Garde la poitrine haute et le dos droit, et utilise le TRX pour l'équilibre et le soutien si besoin.","Pousse dans le talon pour revenir à la position de départ, jambe d'appui complètement tendue.","Fais toutes les répétitions d'un côté avant de changer de côté."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/trx-pistol-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/trx-pistol-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-pistol-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"7c0546f5-1f05-58a7-a3f0-c138ffee1caa","key":"trx-plank","name_fr":"Planche TRX","name_en":"TRX Plank","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"plank","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["rectus_abdominis","transverse_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","obliques"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place les deux pieds dans les sangles du TRX.","Prends la position de planche sur les avant-bras ou de planche haute au sol.","Garde le corps aligné de la tête aux talons.","Gaine les abdominaux et serre les fessiers.","Tiens la position pendant le temps voulu.","Pose les genoux au sol pour terminer."],"image_main":"/exercises/trx-plank/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-plank"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"ec854443-e36f-5532-8a52-942a21e54e5e","key":"trx-row","name_fr":"Rowing TRX","name_en":"TRX Row","aliases_fr":["Tirage TRX"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"row","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","rhomboids"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","posterior_deltoid","trapezius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Saisis les poignées du TRX en prise neutre, paumes face à face.","Penche-toi en arrière en tendant complètement les bras, corps droit de la tête aux talons.","Gaine les abdominaux et tire la poitrine vers tes mains en serrant les omoplates.","Marque une brève pause en haut, puis redescends lentement à la position de départ de façon contrôlée.","Garde le corps rigide tout au long du mouvement, sans creuser au niveau des hanches."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/trx-row/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/trx-row/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-row"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"b3ce1083-683e-50bf-80fc-9d3abfc6d88b","key":"trx-side-plank","name_fr":"Planche latérale TRX","name_en":"TRX Side Plank","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"plank","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["obliques","transverse_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","lateral_deltoid"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Place les deux pieds dans les sangles du TRX et allonge-toi sur le côté.","Appuie-toi sur l'avant-bras du dessous, coude sous l'épaule.","Soulève les hanches pour que le corps forme une ligne droite.","Empile le pied du dessus sur celui du dessous.","Tiens la position en respirant régulièrement.","Redescends et change de côté après la série."],"image_main":"/exercises/trx-side-plank/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-side-plank"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"b8de63ef-7292-55f8-80b4-4e7663ed987e","key":"trx-squat","name_fr":"Squat TRX","name_en":"TRX Squat","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi face au point d'ancrage, poignées en mains, paumes face à face, bras tendus.","Penche-toi légèrement en arrière, corps droit et abdominaux gainés, pieds à largeur d'épaules.","Lance le squat en poussant les hanches en arrière et en fléchissant les genoux, comme pour t'asseoir sur une chaise.","Descends jusqu'à ce que les cuisses soient parallèles au sol ou aussi bas que tu peux, en gardant les sangles tendues.","Pousse dans les talons pour revenir à la position de départ, hanches et genoux complètement tendus."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/trx-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/trx-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"b51093b9-bf71-523a-919e-30d2ddd62bac","key":"trx-tricep-extension","name_fr":"Extension triceps TRX","name_en":"TRX Triceps Extension","aliases_fr":["Skull crusher TRX"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"overhead-tricep-extension","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","push","calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, dos à l'ancrage, poignées TRX en pronation, paumes vers le bas.","Penche-toi en avant, bras tendus devant toi à hauteur d'épaules, pour mettre les sangles sous tension.","Coudes hauts et fixes, fléchis-les pour descendre le corps en amenant les mains vers les tempes.","Tends les coudes avec force pour ramener le corps en position de départ en contractant les triceps.","Garde une position de planche rigide pendant tout le mouvement, abdominaux et fessiers contractés."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/trx-tricep-extension/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/trx-tricep-extension/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-tricep-extension"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"d75e2d50-ae57-583a-9ec4-5bfa81fc7109","key":"trx-y-fly","name_fr":"Y-fly TRX","name_en":"TRX Y-Fly","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":["TRX Y raise"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"reverse-fly","variant_of":null,"equipment":["suspension_trainer"],"primary_muscles":["posterior_deltoid","trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["lateral_deltoid","rhomboids"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull","calisthenics","shoulder_stability"],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi face au point d'ancrage, poignées en pronation, paumes vers le bas.","Penche-toi en arrière, bras tendus devant toi, en gardant le corps en position de planche.","Monte les bras en Y au-dessus de la tête, en rapprochant les omoplates et en les abaissant, pendant que ton corps se rapproche du point d'ancrage.","Garde une légère flexion fixe des coudes tout au long du mouvement et serre les omoplates en haut.","Contrôle lentement la descente vers la position de départ, en résistant à la traction des sangles."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/trx-y-fly/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/trx-y-fly/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-trx-y-fly"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"befe9d65-801a-5083-a4e7-cf7929d053ff","key":"upright-row","name_fr":"Tirage menton barre","name_en":"Barbell Upright Row","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"upright-row","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["lateral_deltoid","trapezius"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","biceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, une barre en pronation, mains à largeur d'épaules.","Tire la barre droit vers le haut le long du corps jusqu'au menton.","Mène le mouvement avec les coudes, en les gardant au-dessus des mains.","Redescends la barre en contrôlant.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/upright-row/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/upright-row/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-upright-row"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"e7a51b18-02c4-5b91-b3d1-05e00d3bd65d","key":"upward-dog","name_fr":"Chien tête en haut","name_en":"Upward-Facing Dog","aliases_fr":["Urdhva Mukha Svanasana"],"aliases_en":["Up dog"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["erector_spinae","triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","pectoralis_major"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le ventre, les mains à côté des côtes basses et le dessus des pieds au sol.","Appuie sur les mains et tends les bras, en décollant la poitrine puis les cuisses du tapis.","Ramène les épaules en arrière et vers le bas, et garde la nuque longue.","Tiens la position le temps prévu, avec seulement les mains et le dessus des pieds au sol.","Plie les bras et redescends de façon contrôlée."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-upward-dog"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"8bd87751-1097-590c-95d6-68913bbff84e","key":"v-bar-lat-pulldown","name_fr":"Tirage vertical prise neutre (poignée V)","name_en":"V-Bar Lat Pulldown","aliases_fr":["Tirage vertical poignée V"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"lat-pulldown","variant_of":null,"equipment":["lat_pulldown_machine"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","rhomboids","trapezius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Fixe une poignée en V (double D) à la poulie de tirage vertical.","Assieds-toi, cuisses bloquées sous le pad, et attrape la poignée, paumes face à face.","Commence bras complètement tendus au-dessus de la tête.","Tire la poignée jusqu'au sternum en emmenant les coudes vers le bas et légèrement vers l'arrière.","Serre les dorsaux en bas, puis remonte lentement de façon contrôlée.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/v-bar-lat-pulldown/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/v-bar-lat-pulldown/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-v-bar-lat-pulldown"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"c6ec99bb-d4d6-5955-bd0c-a38ba3d39d3b","key":"v-bar-tricep-pushdown","name_fr":"Extension triceps à la poulie barre en V","name_en":"V-Bar Tricep Pushdown","aliases_fr":["Pushdown triceps barre en V"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"tricep-pushdown","variant_of":null,"equipment":["cable"],"primary_muscles":["triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms"],"instructions_fr":["Fixe une barre en V sur une poulie haute.","Place-toi face à la poulie et attrape la barre en V à deux mains, paumes vers le bas.","Pars avec les coudes collés aux flancs, avant-bras parallèles au sol.","Pousse la poignée vers le bas jusqu'à avoir les bras complètement tendus.","Serre les triceps, puis reviens en contrôlant à la position de départ.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions recommandé."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/v-bar-tricep-pushdown/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/v-bar-tricep-pushdown/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-v-bar-tricep-pushdown"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"a01235d7-35ff-53f9-b721-ca4b5216ee5a","key":"v-sit","name_fr":"V-sit","name_en":"V-Sit","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"static-hold","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["obliques","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi au sol, jambes tendues devant toi.","Penche-toi légèrement en arrière et décolle les jambes du sol.","Tends les bras vers l'avant pour que ton corps forme un V.","Équilibre-toi sur les ischions, abdominaux serrés.","Maintiens la position en respirant régulièrement.","Redescends les jambes et le buste pour sortir de la position."],"image_main":"/exercises/v-sit/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-v-sit"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"76074691-ee99-517c-b8d0-19f7ceec2026","key":"v-ups","name_fr":"V-ups","name_en":"V Ups","aliases_fr":["Relevés en V"],"aliases_en":["V sit-ups"],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"leg-raise","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hip_flexors","rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["obliques","transverse_abdominis"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi à plat sur le dos, bras tendus au-dessus de la tête et jambes droites.","Monte simultanément les jambes et le haut du corps l'un vers l'autre.","Amène les mains vers les pieds en haut, pour former un V.","Garde les jambes tendues pendant tout le mouvement.","Redescends les deux extrémités de façon contrôlée jusqu'au sol.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/v-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/v-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-v-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"893e720c-c71b-54b9-be67-3207b529db6b","key":"walking","name_fr":"Marche","name_en":"Walking","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["cardio","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gastrocnemius","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings","hip_flexors","soleus"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s","distance_m"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["full_body"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi droit, poids au-dessus du milieu des pieds et épaules relâchées, pas tirées en arrière.","Avance et pose le talon, puis déroule le pied et pousse avec l'avant du pied et les orteils.","Garde toujours au moins un pied au sol : dès que les deux pieds quittent le sol, tu cours, tu ne marches plus.","Laisse les bras balancer naturellement depuis l'épaule, bras opposé à la jambe opposée, coudes doucement fléchis.","Regarde devant toi plutôt que tes pieds, et respire à un rythme régulier et reproductible.","Continue pendant la durée ou la distance voulue, à une allure où tu pourrais encore tenir une conversation."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-walking"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
