{"id":"b45994eb-4e08-5f5c-bc49-0857bb355377","key":"walking-quad-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement des quadriceps en marchant","name_en":"Walking quad stretch","aliases_fr":["Étirement quadriceps en marchant"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"cardio","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["warmup","mobility","running"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":"d4dc2e2b-35ae-503d-8c7b-72932afd9eb7","equipment":[],"primary_muscles":[],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":null,"metrics":["reps","distance_m"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":[],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"coory","source_ids":["coory-walking-quad-stretch"],"attribution_required":false,"exportable":true},
{"id":"2d6dcf9a-85a7-57c7-9e50-0866dd847960","key":"wall-ball","name_fr":"Wall ball","name_en":"Wall Ball","aliases_fr":["Wall balls","Lancer de médecine-ball au mur","Wall balls avec cible"],"aliases_en":["Wall balls target"],"category":"hyrox","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength","hyrox"],"hyrox_station":8,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["wall_ball"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","rectus_abdominis","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","height_cm"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["full_body","legs","conditioning","ballistic"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi face à un mur, à peu près à un bras de distance, pieds à largeur d'épaules, le ballon contre la poitrine à deux mains.","Garde les coudes sous le ballon et la poitrine haute.","Descends en squat jusqu'à ce que les hanches soient au niveau des genoux ou plus bas, talons au sol.","Pousse fort dans les jambes et les hanches et, en te relevant, lance le ballon vers la cible à deux bras.","Rattrape le ballon à hauteur de poitrine quand il redescend, en laissant les bras l'amortir.","Enchaîne directement sur le squat suivant avec la réception et répète pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":"/exercises/wall-ball/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"coory","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wall-ball","coory-wall-balls-target"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"85d3a90e-a7bd-5cce-8610-d2a74e6d68e6","key":"wall-hamstring-stretch","name_fr":"Étirement ischio-jambiers au mur","name_en":"Wall Hamstring Stretch","aliases_fr":["Étirement ischios au mur"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["gastrocnemius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos au sol à côté d'un mur ou d'un encadrement de porte, les hanches proches du mur.","Lève une jambe et pose le talon contre le mur, le genou aussi tendu que possible sans inconfort.","Garde l'autre jambe à plat au sol et le bas du dos relâché.","Rapproche les hanches du mur pour accentuer l'étirement, ou éloigne-les pour l'atténuer.","Respire lentement et tiens le temps prévu pendant que les ischio-jambiers se relâchent.","Redescends la jambe et recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wall-hamstring-stretch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"9f9563bc-0dcc-5cab-b4e6-180718cf2f72","key":"wall-push-ups","name_fr":"Pompes au mur","name_en":"Wall Push Ups","aliases_fr":["Pompes contre le mur"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"push-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi face à un mur et pose les paumes dessus à hauteur d'épaules.","Recule les pieds jusqu'à ce que les bras soient tendus.","Fléchis les coudes pour amener la poitrine vers le mur.","Garde le corps aligné tout au long du mouvement.","Repousse pour revenir à la position de départ.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/wall-push-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/wall-push-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wall-push-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"981afd5f-e9db-53ab-b374-8aa6a54dffce","key":"wall-sit","name_fr":"Chaise au mur","name_en":"Wall Sit","aliases_fr":["Wall sit"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["hamstrings"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, dos contre un mur.","Glisse vers le bas jusqu'à ce que les cuisses soient parallèles au sol.","Maintiens la position.","Remonte quand tu as terminé."],"image_main":"/exercises/wall-sit/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wall-sit"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"c13c413d-8c8c-5147-9578-4ad3f8e52b84","key":"warrior-one","name_fr":"Guerrier I","name_en":"Warrior I","aliases_fr":["Warrior I","Virabhadrasana I"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","erector_spinae"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Recule un pied et tourne-le vers l'extérieur d'environ 45 degrés, en posant toute la plante.","Fléchis le genou avant au-dessus de la cheville et garde la jambe arrière tendue.","Ramène les deux hanches vers l'avant du tapis et lève les bras au-dessus de la tête.","Tiens la position pendant la durée prévue, côtes rentrées et poitrine haute.","Rapproche les pieds et recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":"/exercises/warrior-one/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-warrior-one"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"3abf751f-bb08-55be-9eb7-1bd13a90f20f","key":"warrior-three","name_fr":"Guerrier III","name_en":"Warrior III","aliases_fr":["Warrior III","Virabhadrasana III"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gluteus_medius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi sur une jambe, genou légèrement fléchi et hanches à niveau.","Penche-toi vers l'avant depuis les hanches pendant que l'autre jambe se lève derrière toi.","Continue jusqu'à ce que le buste et la jambe levée soient à peu près parallèles au sol.","Tends les bras vers l'avant, le long du corps ou sur les côtés, et tiens la posture pendant la durée prévue.","Redescends la jambe et recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":"/exercises/warrior-three/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-warrior-three"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"17a18c60-7462-55b3-a8e5-c2c6c0de942a","key":"warrior-two","name_fr":"Guerrier II","name_en":"Warrior II","aliases_fr":["Warrior II","Virabhadrasana II"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_medius","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","lateral_deltoid"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":["calisthenics"],"instructions_fr":["Place-toi jambes écartées, pied avant tourné à 90 degrés vers l'extérieur et pied arrière légèrement vers l'intérieur.","Fléchis le genou avant au-dessus de la cheville, dans l'axe des orteils du milieu.","Ouvre les hanches et la poitrine sur le côté et tends les bras parallèlement au sol.","Tiens la position pendant la durée prévue, le regard au-dessus de la main avant.","Tends la jambe avant et recommence de l'autre côté."],"image_main":"/exercises/warrior-two/main.webp","image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-warrior-two"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"7cda74a2-5084-58c4-bdd9-90cfdfa57223","key":"weighted-dips","name_fr":"Dips lestés","name_en":"Weighted Dips","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"dips","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dip_station"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major","triceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push"],"instructions_fr":["Fixe un disque à une ceinture de lest autour de la taille, pour que la charge pende entre tes jambes.","Saisis les barres parallèles et monte en appui, bras verrouillés et pieds décollés du sol.","Penche légèrement le buste vers l'avant et descends en fléchissant les coudes jusqu'à ce que les épaules passent sous eux.","Remonte en poussant dans les paumes jusqu'à verrouiller les bras, sans laisser le disque se balancer.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/weighted-dips/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/weighted-dips/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-weighted-dips"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"25fbeb30-b49d-5418-b61c-056a1f84557d","key":"weighted-pull-up","name_fr":"Tractions pronation lestées","name_en":"Weighted Pull-Up","aliases_fr":["Tractions lestées"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"pull-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","posterior_deltoid","rhomboids","trapezius"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Attache un disque à une ceinture de lestage autour de la taille pour que le poids pende entre tes jambes, ou serre la charge entre tes pieds.","Prends la barre de traction en pronation, un peu plus large que les épaules, et suspends-toi bras tendus, jambes serrées.","Tire les coudes vers le bas et vers l'arrière pour amener la poitrine vers la barre jusqu'à ce que le menton la passe.","Redescends en contrôlant jusqu'à la suspension complète, en gardant la tension dans les dorsaux et en laissant la charge se stabiliser avant la répétition suivante.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/weighted-pull-up/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/weighted-pull-up/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-weighted-pull-up"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"7453d0a1-4d00-5474-be62-1d2a218fcc80","key":"weighted-wall-crunch","name_fr":"Crunch lesté jambes au mur","name_en":"Weighted Wall Crunch","aliases_fr":["Crunch lesté"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"crunch","variant_of":null,"equipment":["plates"],"primary_muscles":["rectus_abdominis"],"secondary_muscles":["obliques"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["core"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur le dos et immobilise tes jambes pour que les hanches ne t'aident pas : cale tes pieds contre un mur ou une box, ou garde les jambes levées, genoux fléchis.","Tiens une charge contre ta poitrine à deux mains : un disque, un haltère ou une kettlebell conviennent.","Enroule le buste en décollant les omoplates du sol.","Redescends avec contrôle.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/weighted-wall-crunch/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/weighted-wall-crunch/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-weighted-wall-crunch"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"e7a26793-4f84-5c20-9e03-6339fba94c34","key":"wide-grip-bench-press","name_fr":"Développé couché prise large","name_en":"Wide-Grip Bench Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bench-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell","bench"],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["push"],"instructions_fr":["Allonge-toi sur un banc plat. Prends la barre plus large que les épaules.","Descends la barre au milieu de la poitrine.","Repousse jusqu'à l'extension complète.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/wide-grip-bench-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/wide-grip-bench-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wide-grip-bench-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"6dc9c62e-58e5-5895-a1e1-44972cc96470","key":"wide-grip-pull-ups","name_fr":"Tractions pronation prise large","name_en":"Wide Grip Pull Ups","aliases_fr":["Tractions prise large"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"pull-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":["pull_up_bar"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","posterior_deltoid","rhomboids","trapezius"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Prends la barre de traction en pronation, plus large que les épaules.","Suspends-toi bras en extension complète et abdominaux gainés.","Amène la poitrine vers la barre en tirant les coudes vers le bas.","Garde les épaules tirées vers l'arrière pendant la montée.","Redescends en contrôlant jusqu'à l'extension complète.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/wide-grip-pull-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/wide-grip-pull-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wide-grip-pull-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"270fe907-6a6c-593c-81c1-708c853e482b","key":"wide-grip-push-ups","name_fr":"Pompes prise large","name_en":"Wide Grip Push Ups","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"push-up","variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["pectoralis_major"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid","serratus_anterior","triceps_brachii"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Mets-toi en planche haute, mains plus larges que les épaules.","Garde le corps aligné de la tête aux talons.","Descends la poitrine vers le sol en fléchissant les coudes.","Garde les abdominaux gainés et les fessiers contractés.","Repousse jusqu'à ce que les bras soient tendus.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/wide-grip-push-ups/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/wide-grip-push-ups/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wide-grip-push-ups"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"356601ab-e4a5-53cc-a4ac-3a394b57174d","key":"wide-grip-seated-cable-row","name_fr":"Tirage horizontal à la poulie prise large","name_en":"Wide Grip Seated Cable Row","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"row","variant_of":null,"equipment":["cable"],"primary_muscles":["latissimus_dorsi","rhomboids"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","posterior_deltoid"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["pull"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi à la station de tirage horizontal, pieds sur la plateforme.","Saisis une barre large en pronation.","Tire la barre vers le haut des abdominaux en serrant les omoplates.","Tends les bras pour revenir à la position de départ de façon contrôlée.","Répète."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/wide-grip-seated-cable-row/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/wide-grip-seated-cable-row/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wide-grip-seated-cable-row"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"ec059efa-0395-545c-99a8-0eb8f034ba30","key":"wide-legged-forward-fold","name_fr":"Flexion avant jambes écartées","name_en":"Wide-Legged Forward Fold","aliases_fr":["Prasarita Padottanasana"],"aliases_en":["Prasarita Padottanasana"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["adductors","hamstrings"],"secondary_muscles":["erector_spinae","gastrocnemius"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["duration_s"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds largement écartés et bords extérieurs parallèles.","Pose les mains sur les hanches, sors la poitrine et penche-toi en avant en pliant aux hanches.","Amène les mains au sol sous les épaules et laisse la tête pendre.","Tiens la flexion le temps prévu, en déplaçant légèrement le poids vers l'avant des pieds.","Ramène les mains sur les hanches et remonte le dos plat."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wide-legged-forward-fold"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"2fb74c32-b042-592b-82ef-d0c59e7c2eba","key":"wide-stance-leg-press","name_fr":"Presse à cuisses pieds écartés","name_en":"Wide-Stance Leg Press","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"leg-press","variant_of":null,"equipment":["leg_press"],"primary_muscles":["adductors"],"secondary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","hamstrings","quadriceps"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Règle le dossier et le siège pour que ton bas du dos reste appuyé en bas de la répétition.","Place les pieds écartés sur la plateforme, orteils tournés vers l'extérieur seulement autant que les genoux peuvent suivre confortablement.","Descends le chariot en fléchissant hanches et genoux, genoux dans l'axe des orteils et pieds à plat.","Pousse avec tout le pied et étends hanches et genoux, sans forcer les genoux en verrouillage.","Redescends le chariot de façon contrôlée et répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/wide-stance-leg-press/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/wide-stance-leg-press/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wide-stance-leg-press"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"b048c1df-2ac6-56bb-b622-574c3fc7283e","key":"worlds-greatest-stretch","name_fr":"World's greatest stretch","name_en":"World's Greatest Stretch","aliases_fr":["Meilleur étirement du monde","Étirement complet avec rotation"],"aliases_en":["World greatest stretch with rotation"],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":[],"primary_muscles":["hamstrings","hip_flexors"],"secondary_muscles":["adductors","gluteus_maximus","obliques"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","duration_s"],"unilateral":true,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Pars en position de pompe, mains sous les épaules et corps en ligne droite.","Avance un pied à l'extérieur de la main du même côté dans une fente profonde, la jambe arrière tendue.","Garde la main du côté de la jambe arrière plantée sous l'épaule et descends les hanches vers le sol.","Tourne la poitrine vers la jambe avant en levant le bras de ce côté jusqu'à pointer le plafond, et suis ta main des yeux.","Tiens la position ouverte le temps d'une respiration, puis repose la main au sol.","Reviens en position de pompe et recommence de l'autre côté, en alternant pour le nombre de répétitions prévu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-worlds-greatest-stretch","coory-world-greatest-stretch-with-rotation"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"95dc2045-a754-574b-9e5f-8f854996e72a","key":"wrist-curl","name_fr":"Curl poignets haltères","name_en":"Bilateral Dumbbell Wrist Curl","aliases_fr":["Curl poignets bilatéral"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell"],"primary_muscles":["forearm_flexors"],"secondary_muscles":["brachioradialis"],"difficulty":"beginner","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["arms","grip"],"instructions_fr":["Assieds-toi sur un banc avec un haltère dans chaque main, avant-bras posés sur les cuisses, paumes vers le haut.","Laisse les deux haltères rouler jusqu'au bout des doigts.","Remonte les deux haltères en fléchissant les poignets.","Serre en haut, puis redescends en contrôlant.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/wrist-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/wrist-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wrist-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"2bf162d5-e231-5ed5-839d-aa0461059c51","key":"wrist-extension-rocks","name_fr":"Mobilisation des poignets en extension","name_en":"Wrist extension rocks","aliases_fr":["Mobilisation extension du poignet"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"mobility","visibility":"hidden","disciplines":["mobility","warmup"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":null,"variant_of":null,"equipment":["mat"],"primary_muscles":[],"secondary_muscles":[],"difficulty":null,"metrics":["reps"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":true,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":[],"image_main":null,"image_start":null,"image_end":null,"image_source":null,"source":"coory","source_ids":["coory-wrist-extension-rocks"],"attribution_required":false,"exportable":true},
{"id":"efe63c28-2840-58bd-bdcf-ef671395a3d3","key":"wrist-roller","name_fr":"Wrist roller","name_en":"Wrist Roller","aliases_fr":["Enrouleur de poignets"],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"wrist-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["wrist_roller"],"primary_muscles":["forearm_extensors","forearm_flexors"],"secondary_muscles":["anterior_deltoid"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Attrape la poignée du wrist roller, coudes fléchis le long du corps et avant-bras devant toi à hauteur de taille.","Laisse le poids pendre au bout de la corde.","Fais tourner la poignée vers l'avant avec des mouvements alternés des poignets pour enrouler le poids.","Garde les coudes le long du corps pendant tout l'exercice.","Une fois le poids complètement remonté, inverse la rotation pour le redescendre.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/wrist-roller/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/wrist-roller/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-wrist-roller"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"8aacedc4-e260-50df-82bd-408d2bf89d3f","key":"zercher-squat","name_fr":"Zercher squat","name_en":"Zercher Squat","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"squat","variant_of":null,"equipment":["barbell"],"primary_muscles":["gluteus_maximus","quadriceps"],"secondary_muscles":["biceps_brachii","erector_spinae","hamstrings"],"difficulty":"advanced","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":["legs"],"instructions_fr":["Place une barre dans un rack à peu près à hauteur de taille, approche-toi et cale-la dans le pli des coudes, avant-bras croisés ou mains jointes devant la poitrine.","Décroche la barre, recule d'un pas et tiens-toi debout, pieds à peu près à largeur d'épaules.","Gaine les abdominaux, garde la poitrine haute et les coudes serrés l'un contre l'autre.","Descends en fléchissant les hanches et les genoux jusqu'à ce que les cuisses soient au moins parallèles au sol.","Pousse dans le milieu des pieds pour te redresser.","Répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu, puis repose la barre dans le rack."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/zercher-squat/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/zercher-squat/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-zercher-squat"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false},
{"id":"e780b09b-93dd-5e59-a152-8785d8908cfb","key":"zottman-curl","name_fr":"Zottman curl","name_en":"Zottman Curl","aliases_fr":[],"aliases_en":[],"category":"strength","visibility":"active","disciplines":["strength"],"hyrox_station":null,"family":"bicep-curl","variant_of":null,"equipment":["dumbbell"],"primary_muscles":["biceps_brachii"],"secondary_muscles":["brachialis","brachioradialis","forearm_extensors"],"difficulty":"intermediate","metrics":["reps","load_kg","tempo"],"unilateral":false,"bodyweight":false,"tags":[],"instructions_fr":["Tiens-toi debout, pieds à peu près à largeur de hanches, les bras le long du corps et un haltère dans chaque main, paumes vers l'avant.","Garde le haut des bras contre les côtes et monte les deux haltères vers les épaules sans balancer le buste.","En haut, garde les coudes fléchis et tourne les avant-bras jusqu'à ce que les paumes regardent vers le bas.","Redescends les haltères lentement en pronation jusqu'à avoir les bras tendus.","Retourne les paumes vers l'avant en bas et répète pour le nombre de répétitions voulu."],"image_main":null,"image_start":"/exercises/zottman-curl/start.webp","image_end":"/exercises/zottman-curl/end.webp","image_source":"repdb","source":"repdb","source_ids":["repdb-zottman-curl"],"attribution_required":true,"exportable":false}
